1
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:08,870
（网飞公司）

2
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:17,660
{\an8}制作公司
双重挑战公司

3
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:25,250
{\an8}序  幕

4
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:37,750
{\an8}（极北之地 1857年）

5
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:55,700
Captain!
船长！

6
00:01:01,830 --> 00:01:02,830
Captain!
船长！

7
00:01:04,290 --> 00:01:05,500
Can we talk?
能聊聊吗？

8
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:14,580
We must break through the ice.
我们必须破冰前行

9
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:17,040
The men are hungry and exhausted.
大家都很饿 也累坏了

10
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:20,620
We cannot keep up this pace without consequence.
要是继续这样下去 恐怕会付出代价

11
00:01:25,290 --> 00:01:26,580
Listen up, men!
大家听着！

12
00:01:27,870 --> 00:01:32,700
The more we delay the labor, the firmer the grasp of the ice will become.
我们拖得越久 冰就冻得越牢固

13
00:01:33,450 --> 00:01:34,750
The work continues.
继续干活

14
00:01:35,290 --> 00:01:36,700
Rotate each group.
各组轮流作业

15
00:01:36,790 --> 00:01:37,950
Sir, with respect…
先生 请听我说

16
00:01:38,450 --> 00:01:39,910
The men need assurances.
大家需要一句准话

17
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:40,950
Assurances?
准话？

18
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:44,790
Yes, that we will head back to St. Petersburg once we free the ship.
对 就是让船动起来之后 我们会回圣彼得堡去

19
00:01:44,870 --> 00:01:47,580
They don't think we'll be seaworthy for long and they want to know--
他们觉得我们的船航行不了多久了 他们想知道…

20
00:01:47,660 --> 00:01:49,080
Listen up!
都听好了！

21
00:01:50,910 --> 00:01:55,870
It is neither your place, nor the officer here, to think anything…
别的任何事情 都不是你们和这位长官该考虑的

22
00:01:55,950 --> 00:01:59,120
We signed up for a mission and we will see it to completion.
我们接受了一项任务 就要把它完成

23
00:01:59,830 --> 00:02:01,750
We will reach the North Pole.
我们一定会到达北极

24
00:02:01,830 --> 00:02:03,450
Is it understood?
都听明白了吗？

25
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,330
An explosion, Captain.
船长 那里爆炸了…

26
00:02:43,540 --> 00:02:45,080
About two miles away.
离这里大约三公里

27
00:02:51,580 --> 00:02:53,080
Get the men.
去救人

28
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:12,910
The sled dogs are unharmed.
雪橇犬没受伤

29
00:03:13,410 --> 00:03:15,120
Then where does all this blood come from?
那这血是哪来的？

30
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,620
Over here, Captain!
船长 在那里！

31
00:03:18,370 --> 00:03:20,450
A wounded man, he's lost a lot of blood.
有个受了伤的人 他流了好多血

32
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,910
Wound to the shoulder, his leg is broken.
肩膀受伤了 腿断了

33
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,200
Bear attack?
是被熊咬的吗？

34
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:29,870
I don't think so, Captain.
我觉得不是 船长

35
00:03:29,950 --> 00:03:31,700
Larsen, help me with his boot.
拉森 来帮我把这只靴子脱下来

36
00:03:42,580 --> 00:03:43,950
A prosthetic leg.
是个假肢

37
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,330
Put him on the board.
把他抬船上去

38
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,450
Hurry! To the ship! Now!
快 抬上船 赶紧！

39
00:04:02,830 --> 00:04:04,620
Larsen, that thing is coming.
拉森 那东西来了

40
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:09,540
Ready the rifles!
步枪准备！

41
00:04:14,580 --> 00:04:15,950
On my command.
听我指令

42
00:04:20,580 --> 00:04:21,700
Aim!
瞄准！

43
00:04:22,790 --> 00:04:24,160
Fire!
开火！

44
00:04:35,790 --> 00:04:36,910
Next group!
下一组！

45
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,500
Fire!
开火！

46
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:56,450
All to the ship!!
全部上船！

47
00:05:17,500 --> 00:05:19,040
Where is that man we brought onboard?
我们抬上船的那个人呢？

48
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:19,950
Where?
他在哪里？

49
00:05:20,870 --> 00:05:22,580
What is that thing? What does it want?
那究竟是什么东西？它想干什么？

50
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:34,660
Bring him to me!
把他给我！

51
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:50,750
The blunderbuss. Larsen, get the blunderbuss!
喇叭枪 拉森 拿喇叭枪！

52
00:06:01,910 --> 00:06:03,410
Victor.
维克多

53
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,160
Victor!
维克多！

54
00:06:19,790 --> 00:06:20,870
I killed it.
我杀了它

55
00:06:21,410 --> 00:06:22,500
I killed it.
我杀了它

56
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:37,000
It's still alive!
它还活着！

57
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,200
Ladder!
梯子！

58
00:06:38,290 --> 00:06:39,620
Pull up the ladder!
快收梯子！

59
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:58,580
Bring him to me!
把他交出来！

60
00:07:16,790 --> 00:07:18,540
How many shots are left?
还剩几发？

61
00:07:18,620 --> 00:07:20,080
One, but it can't kill it.
一发 但杀不了它

62
00:07:20,620 --> 00:07:21,700
I know.
我知道

63
00:07:22,540 --> 00:07:23,870
I'm not aiming for him.
我也不是要打他

64
00:08:15,540 --> 00:08:18,790
Laudanum, to ease the pain. Drink it. Drink it.
这是鸦片酊 能止痛 喝吧

65
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,540
Where am I?
我这是在哪里？

66
00:08:25,620 --> 00:08:27,330
You are on the Royal Danish ship, Horisont.
这是丹麦皇家航船霍莱松特号

67
00:08:27,410 --> 00:08:29,250
I'm Captain Anderson. This is Dr. Udsen.
我是安德森船长 这位是邬德森医生

68
00:08:29,330 --> 00:08:31,370
How many of your men did it kill?
那怪物杀了你们多少人？

69
00:08:33,910 --> 00:08:34,750
Six.
六个

70
00:08:34,830 --> 00:08:37,200
It will come back and kill many more.
它会回来 让更多人丧命

71
00:08:37,950 --> 00:08:41,750
All of you, if necessary, unless you deliver me to it.
要是不把我交出去 你们都会没命

72
00:08:41,830 --> 00:08:43,450
No, no. It's gone.
不会的 它不在了

73
00:08:43,540 --> 00:08:45,410
It sank in the freezing waters. It's dead.
它沉入了冰水 死了

74
00:08:45,500 --> 00:08:47,120
No, it is not!
它没死！

75
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:48,830
It cannot die.
它死不了

76
00:08:49,450 --> 00:08:51,160
I have tried to destroy it.
我一直尝试彻底摧毁它

77
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:55,410
Whether you believe me or not,
不管你们信不信

78
00:08:57,450 --> 00:09:00,200
it will come back… for me.
它都会回来 找我

79
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,120
And when it does,
等它真的回来了

80
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:06,660
you must promise that you will put me out on the ice
一定要把我送到外面的冰面上

81
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:07,910
and let it take me.
让它带走我

82
00:09:09,290 --> 00:09:10,120
Please.
求你们了

83
00:09:10,700 --> 00:09:12,620
What manner of creature is that?
那究竟是什么？

84
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:16,870
What manner of devil made him?
是什么样的魔鬼造出来的？

85
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,000
I did.
是我

86
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:22,950
I did.
就是我

87
00:09:24,290 --> 00:09:25,500
I made him.
是我亲手造的他

88
00:09:27,870 --> 00:09:32,370
I had determined that the memory of my evils should die with me.
我本已下定决心 让那些罪恶的记忆和我一同消亡

89
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,160
It's ready.
准备好了

90
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:37,580
Some of what I will tell you is fact.
接下来我要说的话 有些是真的

91
00:09:39,660 --> 00:09:42,580
Some is not, but it is all true.
有些是假的 但这是真的

92
00:09:42,660 --> 00:09:44,790
My name is Victor.
我叫维克多

93
00:09:45,370 --> 00:09:46,790
Victor Frankenstein.
维克多·弗兰肯斯坦

94
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:51,000
It was my father who gave me that name.
我的名字是父亲起的

95
00:09:51,830 --> 00:09:53,330
Do you know what it means?
你知道这名字是什么意思吗？

96
00:09:53,410 --> 00:09:55,790
I believe I do, yes. Conqueror.
应该是征服者的意思

97
00:09:56,580 --> 00:09:57,750
One that wins it all.
赢得一切的人

98
00:09:57,830 --> 00:09:59,870
Yes. It all started with him.
没错 一切因他而起

99
00:10:00,450 --> 00:10:01,370
My father.
我的父亲

100
00:10:04,290 --> 00:10:05,330
And my mother.
还有我的母亲

101
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:10,450
Victor!
维克多！

102
00:10:09,590 --> 00:10:13,530
{\an8}第一部分
维克多的故事

103
00:10:12,660 --> 00:10:13,500
Victor!
维克多！

104
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,250
Victor!
维克多！

105
00:10:20,700 --> 00:10:23,830
Come down, your father is arriving.
快下来 你父亲来了

106
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:27,750
Maman?
妈妈？

107
00:10:28,950 --> 00:10:30,370
I'm here, Mother.
母亲 我在这里

108
00:10:33,910 --> 00:10:35,120
I'm here.
这里

109
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:41,410
My father was a baron and a preeminent surgeon.
我父亲是男爵 也是个杰出的外科医生

110
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:44,660
He had married my mother largely out of convenience,
他娶我母亲 很大程度上为了利益

111
00:10:44,750 --> 00:10:47,750
as her dowry was considerable and her lineage noble.
因为母亲的陪嫁相当丰厚 而且她是贵族出身

112
00:10:47,830 --> 00:10:53,200
It furnished my father with the means to preserve his rank and family estate.
她带来的资金 足以让父亲维持爵位和家族产业

113
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:08,000
He was absent from our lives,
日常生活中 从来看不见父亲的身影

114
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:11,000
but when he came home, the entire household bent to his will.
而每当他回到家 所有人都对他唯命是从

115
00:11:11,540 --> 00:11:12,660
Claire, dear.
亲爱的克莱尔

116
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:14,370
The rest of the time…
他不在的时候…

117
00:11:15,250 --> 00:11:16,160
Victor.
维克多

118
00:11:16,250 --> 00:11:17,250
Father.
父亲

119
00:11:17,330 --> 00:11:19,500
The rest of the time, Mother was mine.
他不在的时候 母亲就是我一个人的

120
00:11:27,290 --> 00:11:29,540
No, bring that here.
别拿走 端到这里来

121
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:39,160
The salts in the meat will enrich your blood,
肉里的盐分能滋养你的血液

122
00:11:39,250 --> 00:11:40,540
as well as the baby's.
还有胎儿的

123
00:11:41,250 --> 00:11:42,790
You eat for two, remember?
一人吃 两人补 记得吗？

124
00:11:53,950 --> 00:11:54,950
Go on.
吃吧

125
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:57,120
It's nutritious.
很有营养

126
00:12:03,500 --> 00:12:04,500
Guardian angel.
守护天使

127
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,500
Sweet companion.
甜蜜的陪伴

128
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:09,410
Stand by my side and do not leave me.
请守护我 不要离开我

129
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:13,160
Under your mantle, shelter me, and…
用你的披风庇护我 然后…

130
00:12:15,580 --> 00:12:18,700
I would hear them through the wall, arguing incessantly,
我隔着墙听到他们争论不休

131
00:12:18,790 --> 00:12:22,620
yelling at each other about wealth, estate… and me.
对着彼此大吼大叫 话题关于财富和庄园 还有我

132
00:12:23,790 --> 00:12:26,330
Their voices filled me with fear.
他们的争吵声让我万分恐惧

133
00:12:30,950 --> 00:12:32,080
Maman?
妈妈？

134
00:12:34,040 --> 00:12:35,200
Maman?
妈妈？

135
00:12:45,750 --> 00:12:48,200
The man despised us both.
那个男人鄙视我们两个

136
00:12:48,290 --> 00:12:52,120
Our raven black hair, our deep, dark eyes.
讨厌我们乌黑的头发、深色的瞳孔

137
00:12:52,700 --> 00:12:56,790
Even our quiet, at times nervous disposition
就连我们喜好安静、不时紧张的性情

138
00:12:56,870 --> 00:12:59,580
seemed to exasperate him to no end.
似乎也会让他大为光火

139
00:13:00,250 --> 00:13:05,000
List as accurately as you can the ancient classification
古代把体液分为哪几类？

140
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:07,370
of the humors in the human body.
尽量说精确一点

141
00:13:07,450 --> 00:13:11,700
Blood, black bile, yellow bile, and phlegm.
血液、黑胆汁、黄胆汁和黏液

142
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:15,200
Average male heart. Weight?
男性心脏的平均重量是多少？

143
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,830
Nine to eleven ounces, Father.
250到310克 父亲

144
00:13:19,540 --> 00:13:21,950
Average female heart. Weight?
女性心脏的平均重量？

145
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:24,410
Eight to ten ounces.
230到280克

146
00:13:25,500 --> 00:13:26,870
Why do you suppose that is?
你为什么觉得

147
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:29,750
Difference in mass in female heart?
女性的心脏会轻一点？

148
00:13:30,410 --> 00:13:31,660
Depth of emotion?
是因为她们情感更强烈？

149
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:33,950
Tendency to the melancholic?
更容易忧郁吗？

150
00:13:35,250 --> 00:13:39,500
Mass. Volume of blood, Father. Muscular irrigation.
因为质量 血流量 肌肉灌注的不同 父亲

151
00:13:40,040 --> 00:13:43,330
Quite. There is no spiritual content in tissue,
没错 人体组织中没有精神物质

152
00:13:43,410 --> 00:13:45,290
and no emotion in a muscle.
肌肉中没有情感

153
00:13:45,370 --> 00:13:48,790
Now, describe the main function of the tricuspid valve, please.
那么 请描述一下三尖瓣的主要功能

154
00:13:51,620 --> 00:13:54,750
I cannot recall, Father, but I'm sure I will remember.
我现在想不起来了 父亲 但我肯定能想起来

155
00:13:54,830 --> 00:13:56,250
Yeah, I'm sure you will.
嗯 我相信你

156
00:13:56,950 --> 00:13:59,000
Ivory does not bleed, Victor.
象牙不会流血 维克多

157
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:00,330
Flesh does.
但人体会

158
00:14:01,330 --> 00:14:04,330
By the time you remember a fact, your patient could be dead.
等你想起了某个知识要点 恐怕你的病人已经一命呜呼了

159
00:14:04,410 --> 00:14:05,790
You understand?
懂了吗？

160
00:14:10,290 --> 00:14:13,330
The main function of the tricuspid valve
三尖瓣的主要功能

161
00:14:13,830 --> 00:14:16,910
is to prevent the reflux of blood into the vena cava.
是防止血液反流至腔静脉

162
00:14:19,700 --> 00:14:22,910
No, not your hands. Not anymore.
不打手了 再也不打了

163
00:14:23,950 --> 00:14:26,580
They are now the instruments of your craft and will,
它们如今是你施展技艺的工具 是你意志的延伸

164
00:14:27,620 --> 00:14:29,040
and we must care for them.
要好好保护

165
00:14:31,870 --> 00:14:34,660
Your face, however, is vanity.
而你的脸 就微不足道了

166
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:46,830
You bear my name, Victor, and with it my reputation.
维克多 你沿用了我的名字 也必然要维护我的名声

167
00:14:50,750 --> 00:14:52,500
I pray you remember that.
我恳请你牢记这一点

168
00:14:58,250 --> 00:15:00,580
I feel you have something very good, parce que…
我感觉你有很好的牌

169
00:15:01,830 --> 00:15:03,080
Three…
三

170
00:15:03,160 --> 00:15:04,410
Two…
二

171
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:05,370
One…
一

172
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,700
That's impossible.
不可能

173
00:15:10,450 --> 00:15:11,450
I'll shuffle.
我来洗牌

174
00:15:17,330 --> 00:15:18,450
Mother?
母亲？

175
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:21,000
Maman?
妈妈？

176
00:15:26,620 --> 00:15:27,950
Father!
父亲

177
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:29,450
Father. It's Mother.
父亲 母亲出事了

178
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:37,700
Maman.
妈妈

179
00:15:37,790 --> 00:15:40,540
I need hot water and clean linen. A lot of it.
准备好热水和干净的亚麻布 多拿一点 快

180
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:41,450
-Now. -Sir.
是 先生

181
00:15:41,540 --> 00:15:42,540
-No, Victor! -Mother?
-不 维克多 -妈妈？

182
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:45,500
-Maman! -Victor!
-妈妈! -维克多!

183
00:15:49,330 --> 00:15:51,870
Father! Father!
父亲！

184
00:15:51,950 --> 00:15:53,410
-Victor! -Save her, please!
一定要救她 求你了！

185
00:16:35,910 --> 00:16:41,120
My mother, whom I had come to consider a part of my very self,
我的母亲 我曾将她视作我的一部分

186
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:44,500
she who I thought would never leave,
我曾以为她永远不会离去

187
00:16:45,370 --> 00:16:49,330
she who was life… was now death.
以为她是我的生命 如今她死了

188
00:16:50,750 --> 00:16:52,830
Her eyes extinguished,
她的双眼已暗淡无光

189
00:16:53,830 --> 00:16:57,040
her smile feeding the cold earth.
笑容被冰冷的土地埋葬

190
00:17:04,500 --> 00:17:05,500
Leave!
走开！

191
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:07,200
All of you, leave!
都给我走开！

192
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:17,950
A part of the universe had been hollowed out
我的世界空了一块

193
00:17:19,120 --> 00:17:22,830
and the firmament was now permanently dark.
我的头顶笼罩着永远的黑暗

194
00:17:24,540 --> 00:17:26,040
Now, cover your eyes.
遮住眼睛

195
00:17:28,370 --> 00:17:30,790
Don't look until I tell you to.
我叫你看再看哦

196
00:17:32,620 --> 00:17:33,620
Now.
看吧

197
00:17:33,700 --> 00:17:36,790
William grew full of sunshine and smiles.
威廉在阳光和笑容中长大

198
00:17:36,870 --> 00:17:41,540
He was of a calmer, gentler disposition, clearly favored by my father.
他的性情比我平和温顺 显然更讨父亲喜欢

199
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,660
Thank you, Father.
谢谢你 父亲

200
00:17:43,750 --> 00:17:45,410
Oh, it's a pleasure, my boy.
不客气 儿子

201
00:17:46,700 --> 00:17:49,580
He was the breeze, I was the storm cloud.
他是宜人的微风 我是滚滚的黑云

202
00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:53,870
He was all laughter, I was all frowns.
他带来欢声笑语 我让人愁眉不展

203
00:17:53,950 --> 00:17:55,000
Pick up the reins.
拿起缰绳

204
00:17:55,500 --> 00:17:58,370
Look at me, Father. Look at me.
父亲 看我做得怎么样

205
00:17:59,790 --> 00:18:01,450
There was something more.
不止如此

206
00:18:02,540 --> 00:18:05,290
Or rather, something was missing.
更确切地说 某些东西被忽视了

207
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:09,080
My mother had died
我的母亲

208
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:12,620
at the hands of the most distinguished doctor of his day:
死在如日中天的名医

209
00:18:12,700 --> 00:18:13,870
My father.
我的父亲手下

210
00:18:14,910 --> 00:18:18,700
An idea… took shape in my mind.
我的脑中渐渐有了个想法

211
00:18:19,330 --> 00:18:21,450
Define the circulatory system, if you will…
请说说《心血运动论》中…

212
00:18:21,540 --> 00:18:24,620
Inevitable, unavoidable…
无可避免 无法逃避

213
00:18:25,120 --> 00:18:28,200
…as enunciated in De Motu Cordis.
…对循环系统是怎么定义的

214
00:18:28,290 --> 00:18:30,040
…until it became truth.
…直到这个想法被说了出来

215
00:18:30,540 --> 00:18:31,450
Father?
父亲？

216
00:18:35,450 --> 00:18:36,950
You let her die, did you not?
你没救她 对吗？

217
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:41,120
I did everything in my power to save her. You must know that.
我用尽全力救她了 你必须知道这一点

218
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,410
So you failed.
这么说 你失败了

219
00:18:43,370 --> 00:18:45,620
-No one can conquer death.
没人能战胜死亡

220
00:18:50,250 --> 00:18:52,540
I will. I will conquer it.
我能 我会战胜的

221
00:18:54,290 --> 00:18:57,330
Everything you know, I will know. And more.
我会掌握你掌握的所有知识 还会更进一步

222
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:01,120
I think we've done quite enough for today.
今天就到此为止吧

223
00:19:03,830 --> 00:19:06,160
I was born anew that night.
那晚我重生了

224
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:08,290
I had a vision.
我看到了幻象

225
00:19:09,370 --> 00:19:12,540
I saw, for the first time…
我第一次看到了

226
00:19:13,120 --> 00:19:14,830
the Dark Angel.
黑暗天使

227
00:19:28,830 --> 00:19:30,410
And it made me a promise.
它向我许下承诺

228
00:19:32,160 --> 00:19:35,790
I would have command over the forces of life and death.
我将能掌控生死

229
00:19:37,500 --> 00:19:40,250
I would become every ounce the surgeon my father was.
成为和父亲一样杰出的外科医生

230
00:19:40,330 --> 00:19:43,500
I would surpass him in ambition and in reach.
我的野心和成就将超过他

231
00:19:43,580 --> 00:19:44,870
Guardian angel.
守护天使…

232
00:19:45,620 --> 00:19:46,910
The vision was so clear.
幻象如此清晰

233
00:19:47,660 --> 00:19:51,290
Clearer than anything I'd ever seen in my waking hours or dreams.
无论清醒还是睡梦中 我都从未看到如此清晰的景象

234
00:19:54,910 --> 00:19:55,870
But how?
但承诺如何兑现？

235
00:20:19,500 --> 00:20:21,200
My downfall was swift.
我的境遇很快一落千丈

236
00:20:22,750 --> 00:20:25,950
Two revolts and a fire on my mother's plantations
母亲的种植园 经历了两次叛乱和一场火灾

237
00:20:26,040 --> 00:20:27,620
dwindled the family fortune.
家族财富因此锐减

238
00:20:28,370 --> 00:20:31,200
We kept the estate, but lost everything else.
庄园留下了 但别的全都没了

239
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:49,580
William went to one side of the family in Vienna
威廉被送去了维也纳的亲戚家

240
00:20:49,660 --> 00:20:51,910
and I to London, then Edinburgh.
我去了伦敦 然后又去了爱丁堡

241
00:20:52,830 --> 00:20:56,620
And there, for decades, I tried to…
在那里 我花了数十年时间

242
00:20:58,870 --> 00:21:02,120
expand the narrow limits of academia.
尝试为狭隘的学术界拓宽边界

243
00:21:04,080 --> 00:21:05,000
Life.
生命

244
00:21:06,380 --> 00:21:12,700
{\an8}（皇家医学院纪律法庭 1855年）

245
00:21:06,620 --> 00:21:10,500
This… is life, gentlemen.
这就是生命 先生们

246
00:21:12,790 --> 00:21:13,950
We are born.
我们出生了

247
00:21:15,580 --> 00:21:18,410
And no sooner do we rise, we fall.
刚上去没多久 就掉下来了

248
00:21:19,410 --> 00:21:20,500
Death.
死了

249
00:21:22,450 --> 00:21:25,910
And in the space between that rise and fall,
这一起一落之间

250
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:27,830
our humble little purview.
就是我们渺小卑微的一生

251
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:31,870
Now, birth is not in our hands.
出生不为我们所控

252
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,000
Is it?
对不对？

253
00:21:35,450 --> 00:21:40,000
Conception, that spark, the animation of thought and soul.
生命之火的点燃 思想和灵魂的诞生

254
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:42,370
That is in God's hands.
掌握在上帝的手中

255
00:21:43,330 --> 00:21:44,250
God.
上帝

256
00:21:45,330 --> 00:21:46,410
But death.
而死亡

257
00:21:48,040 --> 00:21:49,660
Ah, now there lies the challenge.
挑战正在此处

258
00:21:50,160 --> 00:21:51,950
That should be our concern.
死亡应该掌握在我们手中

259
00:21:53,290 --> 00:21:54,370
It should be.
应该如此

260
00:21:55,580 --> 00:21:58,790
Who are we to do so? We are not gods, are we?
我们凭什么能掌控？ 我们又不是神明 对不对？

261
00:21:59,410 --> 00:22:02,660
But if we are to behave as immodestly as gods,
但要是我们能像神明那般大胆

262
00:22:02,750 --> 00:22:05,620
we must, at the very least, deliver miracles.
那至少能够创造奇迹

263
00:22:06,120 --> 00:22:07,250
Wouldn't you say?
是不是？

264
00:22:08,250 --> 00:22:12,450
Ignite a divine spark…in these young students' minds.
在年轻学子心中点燃神圣火花

265
00:22:12,540 --> 00:22:15,700
Teach them defiance rather than obedience.
教导他们抛弃顺从 违抗权威

266
00:22:15,790 --> 00:22:21,450
Show that man may pursue nature to her hiding places and stop death.
展示人类有可能掌控自然奥秘 让死亡不再发生

267
00:22:21,540 --> 00:22:24,450
Not slow it down, but stop it entirely!
不是延缓死亡 而是长生不老！

268
00:22:30,580 --> 00:22:33,370
Silence. Silence!
安静！

269
00:22:36,910 --> 00:22:42,330
How exactly do you propose to teach what is impossible?
这种不可能的事 你究竟要怎么教？

270
00:22:46,700 --> 00:22:48,160
Composite subject, the body.
人类的尸体 一个复合实体

271
00:22:48,250 --> 00:22:51,370
That of a shopkeeper, delivered mere moments after expiration.
这是某个店老板 刚咽气没多久就送到了我这里

272
00:22:51,950 --> 00:22:53,540
The brain laid bare but functional,
大脑暴露在外 但仍能运作

273
00:22:53,620 --> 00:22:56,160
the spinal branches and vagal nerves intact.
脊神经分支和迷走神经完好无损

274
00:22:56,700 --> 00:22:59,040
You may observe the hair-thin scars.
大家或许能看到一些极细的伤口

275
00:22:59,120 --> 00:23:01,750
No coarse stitching needed by my own technique.
我的手艺无需粗糙的缝合

276
00:23:01,830 --> 00:23:03,000
The arm, you see,
看这条手臂

277
00:23:03,080 --> 00:23:05,620
comes from another specimen, that of a carpenter.
来自某个木匠

278
00:23:05,700 --> 00:23:08,830
The muscles, ligaments, nerves, all connected now.
肌肉、韧带、神经 都已连结好

279
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:32,040
Now, the spasmodic movement of the body
看啊 电流导致躯体痉挛

280
00:23:32,120 --> 00:23:34,120
caused from the electric current, this is not new.
这已不是新鲜事

281
00:23:34,700 --> 00:23:37,700
It's not new. However, the flow of energy through the body
大家都见过 不过 这种躯体内的能量流动

282
00:23:37,790 --> 00:23:39,370
follows a different notion entirely.
遵循一种完全不同的概念

283
00:23:39,450 --> 00:23:41,290
An Eastern notion called qi.
一种称为气的东方概念

284
00:23:41,910 --> 00:23:45,120
Now, it considers the vital flow of energy both within and without.
这种概念认为 生命能量的流动 同时存在于身体内外

285
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:46,870
I'm utilizing needles in six--
我用针在六个…

286
00:23:46,950 --> 00:23:51,040
Quiet! Sit down!
安静！都坐下！

287
00:23:52,750 --> 00:23:56,040
This is a hearing, Doctor, not a carnival act.
医生 这是听证会 不是狂欢节表演

288
00:23:56,120 --> 00:23:58,080
You're not helping your cause, Victor.
你这样无济于事 维克多

289
00:23:58,160 --> 00:24:00,750
This galvanic trickery will simply not do.
这种用电的诡计根本没用

290
00:24:00,830 --> 00:24:01,830
Trickery.
诡计

291
00:24:03,750 --> 00:24:04,750
Trickery?
诡计？

292
00:24:07,040 --> 00:24:08,160
Are you sure?
你确定吗？

293
00:24:13,200 --> 00:24:15,750
That is not trickery. That is a decision.
这不是诡计 而是一种抉择

294
00:24:15,830 --> 00:24:20,160
Motor coordination between the eye of one dead man and the arm of another,
一个死人的眼睛 和另一个死人的胳膊协调运动

295
00:24:20,250 --> 00:24:23,790
infused with a new will and the rudiments of understanding.
注入全新的意志和基本的理解力

296
00:24:23,870 --> 00:24:27,500
Understanding in a brain that already died?
已经死亡的大脑也有理解力吗？

297
00:24:28,540 --> 00:24:29,660
Release now.
放开

298
00:24:31,040 --> 00:24:31,870
Please.
请放开

299
00:24:33,450 --> 00:24:34,660
"Please" always helps.
礼貌一点总有效果

300
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:39,160
Turn that off at once. At once, you charlatan.
赶紧关了吧 你个江湖骗子

301
00:24:39,250 --> 00:24:42,120
This is the future. This is possible.
这就是未来 这是有可能实现的

302
00:24:42,200 --> 00:24:44,290
Why not study it? Why not quantify it?
为什么不研究一下 量化一下呢？

303
00:24:44,370 --> 00:24:50,660
This is unholy. An abomination. An obscenity!
这是罪恶的 可恨、下流！

304
00:24:51,160 --> 00:24:55,910
God gives life, and God takes it, Victor.
生命由上帝赐予 由上帝收回 维克多

305
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:58,500
Perhaps God is inept!
或许上帝就是无能！

306
00:24:59,910 --> 00:25:02,330
And it is we that must amend his mistakes!
要由我们来纠正他的错误！

307
00:25:02,410 --> 00:25:04,950
Do not let these old fools extinguish your voice!
别让这些老蠢货阻止你自由表达！

308
00:25:05,040 --> 00:25:08,410
The answers only come when coaxed by disobedience,
只有采取不盲从的态度 摆脱恐惧和恃强凌弱的教条

309
00:25:08,500 --> 00:25:11,410
free of fear and cowardly dogma!
答案才会浮现！

310
00:25:25,870 --> 00:25:27,160
Professor Krempe.
克伦佩教授

311
00:26:02,040 --> 00:26:05,870
Baron Frankenstein, my name is Heinrich Harlander,
弗兰肯斯坦男爵 我叫海因里希·哈兰德

312
00:26:05,950 --> 00:26:08,700
and I carry with me a letter of introduction
我这里有一封

313
00:26:08,790 --> 00:26:10,160
from your brother, William.
你的弟弟威廉写的介绍信

314
00:26:10,250 --> 00:26:11,200
From my brother?
我弟弟？

315
00:26:11,290 --> 00:26:13,660
I asked for the privilege of your acquaintance.
我希望能有幸认识你

316
00:26:13,750 --> 00:26:15,620
It won't take but a minute of your time.
耽误你一点时间

317
00:26:15,700 --> 00:26:16,870
-Please. -Very well.
-请进 -好

318
00:26:19,580 --> 00:26:21,700
So William is coming to see me, is that it?
这么说 威廉要来看我 对吗？

319
00:26:22,450 --> 00:26:24,160
Yeah, in a matter of days.
对 几天后到

320
00:26:24,870 --> 00:26:29,120
He wants to introduce you to his fiancée. My niece, as it happens.
他想让你见见他的未婚妻 也就是我的侄女

321
00:26:33,410 --> 00:26:36,200
Elizabeth Harlander, a very nice young lady,
她叫伊丽莎白·哈兰德 是一位非常可爱的小姐

322
00:26:36,290 --> 00:26:37,540
fresh from convent life.
刚刚从修道院学校毕业

323
00:26:38,410 --> 00:26:39,410
The photographs are mine.
这些照片都是我拍的

324
00:26:39,910 --> 00:26:43,040
William has become quite successful in the world of finance.
威廉在金融领域很有成就

325
00:26:43,120 --> 00:26:44,830
He's making a name for himself.
弗兰肯斯坦的名声越来越响了

326
00:26:44,910 --> 00:26:47,000
Ha! A name? For himself?
哎哟！是吗？

327
00:26:47,500 --> 00:26:52,540
Well, I'm afraid we both share that name, whether we like it or not.
要知道我们都是弗兰肯斯坦 不管我们乐不乐意

328
00:26:53,120 --> 00:26:54,830
I read your article in The Lancet.
我拜读了你在《柳叶刀》上的文章

329
00:26:55,370 --> 00:26:57,160
You really believe you can do it?
你真的觉得这事能做到吗？

330
00:26:58,290 --> 00:26:59,370
Assemble a man?
组装出一个人来？

331
00:27:00,580 --> 00:27:03,450
A full new body? And give it life?
做出完整的全新人体？还要有生命？

332
00:27:04,790 --> 00:27:06,200
You saw it today, didn't you?
你今天也看到了

333
00:27:06,290 --> 00:27:08,620
What I saw was a crucifixion, really.
说真的 我看到的是你当众受难

334
00:27:08,700 --> 00:27:11,330
You were done for before you uttered a word.
你还没开口说句话 就被钉死了

335
00:27:11,410 --> 00:27:12,750
I still showed them.
但我还是向他们展示了

336
00:27:13,870 --> 00:27:14,700
What?
展示什么？

337
00:27:14,790 --> 00:27:15,620
The truth.
事实

338
00:27:16,410 --> 00:27:18,080
They will forget by suppertime.
他们到晚餐时间就忘了

339
00:27:19,500 --> 00:27:21,950
Yes, yes, yes. But what did you think? 
话虽如此 你觉得怎么样？

340
00:27:24,040 --> 00:27:25,620
I thought it was brilliant.
我觉得非常厉害

341
00:27:27,080 --> 00:27:28,160
It was. I know.
没错 我就知道

342
00:27:28,250 --> 00:27:31,040
But you are like a child, so excited,
但你有点孩子气 太激动了

343
00:27:31,120 --> 00:27:34,200
clutching your new pet so tightly that you're strangling it.
紧抓你的新宠物 快把它勒死了

344
00:27:35,500 --> 00:27:37,450
That is why I worry about you.
我不免为你担心

345
00:27:38,700 --> 00:27:41,160
Can you contain your fire, Prometheus?
你能控制好火种吗 普罗米修斯？

346
00:27:41,250 --> 00:27:44,120
Or are you going to burn your hands before delivering it?
还是没等把它交出去 就先烧伤了自己的手？

347
00:27:46,540 --> 00:27:47,410
Quite.
说得对

348
00:27:48,410 --> 00:27:51,910
Please do not think me rude, but my day has proven long enough,
请不要觉得我无礼 但这一天已经足够漫长

349
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:55,040
and I believe myself totally unfit for the company of strangers.
我的状态也完全不适合 再陪伴陌生人了

350
00:27:55,120 --> 00:27:56,620
So if there's nothing more--
如果没有什么别的事了…

351
00:27:56,700 --> 00:27:58,620
Oh, but there is. Much more.
还有重要的事

352
00:28:01,200 --> 00:28:03,660
I've taken quarters in Edinburgh.
我在爱丁堡找好了住处

353
00:28:03,750 --> 00:28:07,160
Three days from now, we are to meet with William and Elizabeth.
三天后 我们一起见威廉和伊丽莎白

354
00:28:07,250 --> 00:28:10,370
And that evening, I will change your destiny.
我将在那晚改变你的命运

355
00:28:11,700 --> 00:28:14,000
I will show you something extraordinary.
我会让你看到非同凡响的东西

356
00:28:31,410 --> 00:28:35,160
The peach. The peach. Turn the peach. Turn it.
桃子 把桃子转过来

357
00:28:36,700 --> 00:28:38,330
You bit it again.
你又啃了

358
00:28:39,330 --> 00:28:40,830
You're eating the peaches.
你一直在吃桃

359
00:28:41,500 --> 00:28:43,330
This is a memento mori.
这是对死亡的沉思

360
00:28:44,040 --> 00:28:49,410
The peach, symbol of life and youth, and you bite into it?
桃子是生命和青春的符号 怎么就被你啃了？

361
00:28:49,500 --> 00:28:51,700
-I was hungry, Kiki. -Don't call me Kiki.
-我饿了呀 小希 -别那样叫我

362
00:28:51,790 --> 00:28:53,660
Baron Victor Frankenstein, sir.
先生 维克多·弗兰肯斯坦男爵来了

363
00:28:56,040 --> 00:28:56,910
You can leave.
你可以下去了

364
00:28:57,660 --> 00:28:58,750
Forgive me.
抱歉

365
00:29:00,330 --> 00:29:01,200
Welcome.
欢迎

366
00:29:01,290 --> 00:29:02,250
Herr Harlander.
哈兰德先生

367
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:05,870
A young art, photography.
这是一种新兴艺术 摄影

368
00:29:05,950 --> 00:29:07,330
Goodbye, Kiki.
再见 小希

369
00:29:07,410 --> 00:29:09,160
Already a passion of mine.
我已经迷上了

370
00:29:09,750 --> 00:29:11,080
Did you bring the papers?
文件都带来了吗？

371
00:29:12,540 --> 00:29:13,580
Oh, thank you.
谢谢

372
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:19,370
-You're extraordinary. -Thank you.
-你非常出色 -谢谢

373
00:29:23,370 --> 00:29:27,620
You're using the nervous system to deliver the surge of energy.
你利用神经系统来传递能量脉冲

374
00:29:28,700 --> 00:29:29,660
Are you not?
对吗？

375
00:29:29,750 --> 00:29:30,910
Correct.
没错

376
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:35,000
And thus the sustainability of the life force you command
因此 你所操控的生命力 只能维持很短时间

377
00:29:35,080 --> 00:29:38,370
is very brief, wanes, evaporates.
很快就会衰退、消散

378
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:41,000
How so?
为什么这么说？

379
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:48,620
At the lecture, you ended your demonstration out of pride.
当时你颇为自豪地结束了演示

380
00:29:51,410 --> 00:29:53,660
But really, because the galvanic life force
但其实是因为 那股电流般的生命力

381
00:29:53,750 --> 00:29:55,500
was already fading, was it not?
已经衰竭了 对吗？

382
00:29:55,580 --> 00:29:57,200
Are you yourself a surgeon, sir?
先生 你是外科医生吗？

383
00:29:57,700 --> 00:30:00,040
Yeah, once upon a time. An army surgeon.
曾经是 我是战地医生

384
00:30:00,120 --> 00:30:02,700
Not a particularly skilled one, either.
医术也说不上多精湛

385
00:30:02,790 --> 00:30:05,950
But it allowed me to secure the rudiments of my fortune.
但也给我打下了发家致富的基础

386
00:30:06,040 --> 00:30:07,950
I own a few ammunition factories.
我现在有几家军火工厂

387
00:30:08,040 --> 00:30:10,870
-An arms merchant. -A realist.
-你是军火商 -不如说是个务实的

388
00:30:11,450 --> 00:30:13,330
Are you familiar with the Evelyn Tables?
你对伊夫林解剖图表熟悉吗？

389
00:30:13,410 --> 00:30:15,950
Of course. Acquired by Sir John Evelyn,
当然 那是约翰·伊夫林爵士当年

390
00:30:16,040 --> 00:30:18,000
there are four planks, meticulous dissection,
买下的四张人体标本精细解剖图

391
00:30:18,080 --> 00:30:20,120
some of the oldest in Europe, presenting the nerves,
是欧洲最早的人体神经 和动静脉解剖图

392
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:22,080
veins and arteries of cadavers. What?
为什么会提到这个？

393
00:30:22,160 --> 00:30:24,000
Yes. But there's a fifth one.
因为还有第五张

394
00:30:24,910 --> 00:30:26,290
The most compelling one.
这张最让人信服

395
00:30:30,330 --> 00:30:33,000
Exquisite, is it not?
非常细致 是不是？

396
00:30:34,500 --> 00:30:36,580
Flesh rendered onto wood.
呈现于木头上的鲜活血肉

397
00:30:38,290 --> 00:30:41,580
The cadaver lies on the plank, is peeled away layer by layer,
尸体放在木板上 逐层剥离

398
00:30:41,660 --> 00:30:45,370
and the remaining tissue is lacquered with resin onto the wood.
用树脂将剩下的组织固定在木板上

399
00:30:45,450 --> 00:30:48,750
-It showcases the lymphatic system. -Yes.
-这是淋巴系统 -没错

400
00:30:48,830 --> 00:30:52,620
Muslim medics called it the secret circulatory system.
穆斯林医学家称其为隐秘的循环系统

401
00:30:52,700 --> 00:30:58,200
It moves a mere three liters of fluid, but it's a vast network.
仅仅输送三升体液 却构成了庞大的网络

402
00:30:58,290 --> 00:31:00,000
-Oh, it's remarkable. -Yes.
-真是非同凡响 -确实

403
00:31:01,160 --> 00:31:05,160
Now for us, for you, the important variation is here.
现在对我们 也是对你而言 关键的改变就在这里

404
00:31:06,620 --> 00:31:10,290
The ninth configuration. A very delicate,
这第九种构造 环绕心脏的结构

405
00:31:10,370 --> 00:31:13,750
almost ethereal structure surrounding the heart.
极为精巧 近乎空灵

406
00:31:13,830 --> 00:31:17,120
It can distribute, but also store energy.
既能分配能量 也能储存能量

407
00:31:20,790 --> 00:31:23,250
Yes, if you can access that without destroying
如果你能在不破坏周围组织的前提下

408
00:31:23,330 --> 00:31:25,870
-the surrounding tissue-- -No. Not through the front.
-触达这一构造… -不 不是前面

409
00:31:25,950 --> 00:31:29,250
The back, spinal column, thoracic curvature.
是后面 脊柱 胸曲

410
00:31:29,950 --> 00:31:30,830
Of course.
没错

411
00:31:30,910 --> 00:31:36,330
Flow of energy, scarring and regeneration beyond anyone's imagination.
远超人们想象的能量流动 瘢痕形成和组织再生

412
00:31:36,410 --> 00:31:37,700
Life eternal.
永生

413
00:31:39,700 --> 00:31:43,040
I will endow your pursuit with unlimited resources.
我将提供无限的资源 来支持你的研究

414
00:31:45,790 --> 00:31:47,250
And in exchange?
那我要拿什么来交换？

415
00:31:48,750 --> 00:31:50,200
No need to become indelicate.
这么说就俗了

416
00:31:51,250 --> 00:31:54,750
We're searchers for truth and transcendence, kindred spirits.
我们探寻真理 志在超越 有着共同的追求

417
00:31:56,410 --> 00:31:58,370
I may in time ask you for a favor in return,
某天我也许会请你帮个忙 作为回报

418
00:31:58,450 --> 00:32:02,450
but it's mostly the privilege to record your process for posterity.
但最重要的是记录研究过程 以传诸后世的这份特权

419
00:32:02,540 --> 00:32:03,660
I work alone.
我习惯独自工作

420
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:06,160
I'm very quiet.
我绝对不出声

421
00:32:06,250 --> 00:32:09,250
William Frankenstein and your niece, Herr Harlander.
哈兰德先生 威廉·弗兰肯斯坦和您的侄女到了

422
00:32:13,080 --> 00:32:14,200
I shall consider it.
我要考虑一下

423
00:32:15,540 --> 00:32:16,620
I'll consider it.
我会考虑的

424
00:32:17,950 --> 00:32:18,910
Baron.
男爵

425
00:32:20,120 --> 00:32:23,200
Don't pretend to be reasonable now. It would be such a shame.
别假装冷静了 错过了就可惜了

426
00:32:33,620 --> 00:32:34,950
Victor.
维克多

427
00:32:35,040 --> 00:32:36,160
William!
威廉！

428
00:32:36,250 --> 00:32:38,700
-Victor. -Look at you.
-维克多 -瞧瞧你

429
00:32:39,950 --> 00:32:41,620
My, you've grown.
老天 你长大了

430
00:32:41,700 --> 00:32:43,200
Through no merit of my own.
可惜不是我的功劳

431
00:32:44,040 --> 00:32:46,040
May I introduce the woman I'm to marry.
来见见我的未婚妻吧

432
00:32:46,700 --> 00:32:48,250
Lady Elizabeth Harlander.
伊丽莎白·哈兰德小姐

433
00:33:09,700 --> 00:33:11,450
Absolutely delighted.
荣幸之至

434
00:33:16,950 --> 00:33:19,250
Can't say I was shocked when you were expelled,
听到你被驱逐 说实话我也不惊讶

435
00:33:19,870 --> 00:33:22,450
but the manner and virulence of your expulsion,
但他们的态度太强硬 言语太狠毒

436
00:33:22,540 --> 00:33:23,700
uncalled for, I'm sure.
我认为实在没有必要

437
00:33:23,790 --> 00:33:24,910
No, it was called for. 
有必要

438
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:26,000
I earned it.
我应得的

439
00:33:26,500 --> 00:33:29,000
I made it a point to earn it, wouldn't you say, Herr Harlander?
我特意挣来的 你说是不是 哈兰德先生？

440
00:33:29,080 --> 00:33:30,660
It was quite an exit, I assure you.
确实声势浩大

441
00:33:32,330 --> 00:33:33,410
Why provoke them?
为什么要激怒他们？

442
00:33:33,500 --> 00:33:37,410
Why not just carry on without calling attention to yourself in such a manner?
何不继续做自己的事 避免惹来不必要的关注？

443
00:33:37,950 --> 00:33:41,120
How safe, even by your standards, William.
威廉 就算以你的标准来看 这么做也太保守了

444
00:33:41,700 --> 00:33:43,250
You almost sound like Father.
你这话听着都有点像父亲了

445
00:33:44,660 --> 00:33:47,120
He was a most tactful man, our father.
父亲可是相当老练的

446
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:50,830
He was precise, discreet, measured.
他做事精准、谨慎、有分寸感

447
00:33:50,910 --> 00:33:55,370
I, on the other hand, fail to see why modesty is considered a virtue at all.
我就不是 我完全不懂为何谦虚是一种美德

448
00:33:55,450 --> 00:33:57,750
Victor's always been one to harvest attention.
维克多一直这么引人注目

449
00:33:58,330 --> 00:34:01,620
Even as children, I mitigated his voice by staying silent.
即便在小时候 我也常常 通过保持沉默 来消解他的声音

450
00:34:01,700 --> 00:34:04,580
Perhaps too much and far too many times, wouldn't you say, Victor?
这样的事发生无数次了吧 维克多 你说呢？

451
00:34:04,660 --> 00:34:06,410
If life can be regenerated,
如果可以再造生命

452
00:34:06,950 --> 00:34:08,200
not as a mere simulation,
并非简单的模拟

453
00:34:08,290 --> 00:34:12,200
but as a divine act by physical, chemical means, why whisper it?
而是通过物理化学手段 如神迹般地再造 何不大声说出来？

454
00:34:16,000 --> 00:34:16,870
You laugh?
你笑了？

455
00:34:17,370 --> 00:34:19,700
-You're amused? -I must be, yes.
-你觉得好笑吗？ -没错

456
00:34:19,790 --> 00:34:21,120
Are my ideas not clear?
我的理念没表达清楚吗？

457
00:34:21,200 --> 00:34:23,660
You certainly expressed them loudly enough.
你显然已经够大声的了

458
00:34:23,750 --> 00:34:25,000
Are they not worthwhile?
不值得为之努力吗？

459
00:34:25,080 --> 00:34:27,830
Ideas are not worthwhile by themselves, I don't believe.
我认为理念本身并不值得为之努力

460
00:34:30,250 --> 00:34:31,660
Enlighten me, please.
愿闻其详

461
00:34:32,160 --> 00:34:34,370
Take the war, for example.
拿战争来说

462
00:34:34,450 --> 00:34:37,080
William, cigar and brandy in my study?
威廉 去书房享用雪茄和白兰地吧

463
00:34:37,580 --> 00:34:41,200
Surely you've heard my niece expound on the matter before.
我侄女的长篇大论你肯定都听过了

464
00:34:42,410 --> 00:34:43,450
You'll excuse us.
我们失陪了

465
00:34:48,290 --> 00:34:50,500
Pray, carry on. Ideas.
请继续说 关于理念

466
00:34:51,450 --> 00:34:57,330
Well… honor, country, valor.
这么说吧 荣耀、国家、勇气

467
00:34:58,620 --> 00:35:01,700
These surely are worthwhile, elevated ideas by themselves,
这些必然是值得为之奋斗的崇高理念

468
00:35:01,790 --> 00:35:02,750
wouldn't you agree?
同意吧？

469
00:35:04,290 --> 00:35:06,370
-Mm-hmm. -And nevertheless, men are dying for them.
然而 人们为了这些理念赴死

470
00:35:07,040 --> 00:35:08,950
In a decidedly un-elevated way,
以一种显然毫不崇高的方式

471
00:35:09,040 --> 00:35:11,910
face down in the mud, choking on blood,
脸埋在泥泞里 喉咙呛着血

472
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:13,200
screaming in pain.
痛得大喊大叫

473
00:35:14,040 --> 00:35:17,370
Men that were fathers, brothers or sons to someone out there.
他们是某人的父亲、兄弟或儿子

474
00:35:17,450 --> 00:35:19,370
Men that were fed, cleaned and nursed
他们被自己的母亲带到这个世界

475
00:35:19,450 --> 00:35:21,330
and schooled into this world by their mothers,
被悉心喂养、洗净、照料、教育

476
00:35:21,910 --> 00:35:23,870
only to fall on a battlefield far away,
最后却被送到某个遥远的战场

477
00:35:23,950 --> 00:35:26,160
far from those that provoke these tragedies.
真正制造惨剧的人却躲得远远的

478
00:35:27,370 --> 00:35:31,290
Those men remain at home, untouched by blood or bayonet,
他们好好地待在家中 不沾血 不挨刀

479
00:35:32,410 --> 00:35:35,450
their skin unpierced, their blankets warm and clean.
皮肤完好无损 被窝温暖洁净

480
00:35:38,120 --> 00:35:40,870
That is what happens when ideas are pursued by fools.
这就是蠢人追求理念的后果

481
00:35:40,950 --> 00:35:42,700
And you think me a fool?
那你觉得我是蠢人

482
00:35:46,330 --> 00:35:47,910
Run to your brandy and cigars.
快享用你的白兰地和雪茄去吧

483
00:35:48,580 --> 00:35:49,910
The boys are waiting.
他们都在等着呢

484
00:35:56,330 --> 00:36:01,160
How often a man believes he's met an angel or a devil,
一个人常常以为遇见了天使或魔鬼

485
00:36:02,660 --> 00:36:04,910
only to find it is all an illusion.
到头来却发现一切不过是幻觉

486
00:36:07,950 --> 00:36:09,500
The game of chess we play…
我们下的这盘棋

487
00:36:10,910 --> 00:36:12,750
we play only against ourselves.
对手只有自己

488
00:36:15,160 --> 00:36:16,000
Help him.
帮帮他

489
00:36:16,620 --> 00:36:17,580
Help him!
快点！

490
00:36:18,660 --> 00:36:20,500
Here you go. Drink some.
给 喝点吧

491
00:36:43,200 --> 00:36:44,410
You better come with me.
快跟我来

492
00:36:45,870 --> 00:36:47,200
Nothing.
什么都没有

493
00:36:47,290 --> 00:36:48,910
Sir, the watchman saw him.
先生 看守人看到他了

494
00:36:49,790 --> 00:36:51,450
Circling the ship. In the mist.
在迷雾中绕着船转

495
00:36:51,540 --> 00:36:53,160
We all saw him drown.
我们都亲眼看他沉下去了

496
00:36:53,250 --> 00:36:54,410
Sir.
先生

497
00:36:54,500 --> 00:36:56,000
The men are terrified.
大家都很恐慌

498
00:36:56,080 --> 00:36:58,450
They think that man should be surrendered to the ice
觉得该把那个男人扔到冰面上

499
00:36:58,540 --> 00:36:59,700
and be done with this.
结束这一切

500
00:37:02,330 --> 00:37:04,000
He is under my protection…
他受我保护…

501
00:37:06,450 --> 00:37:08,080
and the protection of the Crown!
受王国庇佑！

502
00:37:21,830 --> 00:37:24,790
A few weeks later, I rode with William and Harlander
几周后 我、威廉和哈兰德 骑马穿过海峡

503
00:37:24,870 --> 00:37:27,450
to a lake near Vaduz across the channel.
来到瓦杜兹附近的一个湖边

504
00:37:27,540 --> 00:37:30,950
The tower was built as a water filtration plant to irrigate the fields.
这座塔楼是用来过滤农田灌溉用水的

505
00:37:31,040 --> 00:37:33,910
Public works, so construction was abandoned at the start of the war.
是个公共工程项目 所以战争一开始就被弃建了

506
00:37:35,080 --> 00:37:36,870
Not this war, the one before.
不是这场战争 是前一场

507
00:37:37,540 --> 00:37:39,660
Or the one before that, I cannot quite remember.
或者是再前面一场 我记不清了

508
00:37:44,500 --> 00:37:46,500
The moment I laid eyes on it…
一看到它

509
00:37:47,620 --> 00:37:48,620
The tower.
这座塔楼

510
00:37:49,370 --> 00:37:52,870
I could feel destiny calling.
我便感受到了命运的召唤

511
00:38:03,790 --> 00:38:05,580
The structure's basically intact.
建筑结构基本完整

512
00:38:05,660 --> 00:38:08,750
And there's a chute going from top, right to the bottom.
这里还有一条陡坡道 从顶上直通到底部

513
00:38:09,410 --> 00:38:11,200
I can arrange for your belongings.
我会安排人把你的个人物品

514
00:38:11,290 --> 00:38:13,160
We'll bring them from Edinburgh.
从爱丁堡运过来

515
00:38:26,950 --> 00:38:29,660
Anything you need or want shall be granted.
你需要什么 都能满足

516
00:38:30,540 --> 00:38:32,200
-Anything? -Anything.
-什么都可以？ -什么都可以

517
00:38:41,830 --> 00:38:45,370
I have secured William's service for the duration of the project.
整个项目期间 威廉随叫随到

518
00:38:45,450 --> 00:38:46,700
I'll need a holding cell.
我要一个临时密室

519
00:38:47,580 --> 00:38:49,500
-And an ice chamber close to the lab. -William.
-实验室旁边要有个冷库 -威廉

520
00:38:50,410 --> 00:38:52,790
There are two pump reservoirs at the base of the tower.
塔楼底部有两个泵水库

521
00:38:52,870 --> 00:38:54,290
We'll repurpose those.
要改造一下

522
00:38:54,370 --> 00:38:56,290
We shall need to recondition the steam engines.
我们要重启蒸汽机

523
00:38:56,370 --> 00:38:58,160
We'll need enough fuel to make sure they run.
需要足够的燃料 来保证机器正常运转

524
00:38:58,750 --> 00:39:02,410
There and there, four high-capacity voltaic batteries,
那里 还有那里 放四块高容量的伏打电池

525
00:39:02,500 --> 00:39:04,160
positive and negative polarity,
正负电极

526
00:39:04,250 --> 00:39:08,450
and a lightning rod system of pure silver telescoping down into the lab.
还要一套纯银避雷针系统 向下延伸至实验室

527
00:39:08,540 --> 00:39:13,540
Yes. My contractors can manufacture any and all equipment you may require.
没问题 你需要什么设备 我的承包商都能造出来

528
00:39:15,500 --> 00:39:18,000
I take it then that we have an understanding?
那么 我们应该达成共识了吧？

529
00:39:25,200 --> 00:39:26,750
A bargain has been struck.
交易达成

530
00:39:37,370 --> 00:39:38,370
Bastard!
混蛋！

531
00:39:40,080 --> 00:39:41,120
No. No. Not this one.
这个不行

532
00:39:45,330 --> 00:39:46,250
Aah. Open your mouth.
张嘴

533
00:39:48,410 --> 00:39:51,540
You, you're lucky to be hanged. You would have died within the year.
被绞死算你走运 你本就活不过今年了

534
00:39:51,620 --> 00:39:54,120
Herr Harlander promised me access to optimal specimens.
哈兰德先生答应我 让我拿到最好的样本

535
00:39:54,200 --> 00:39:55,870
Yeah, that he may have, your lordship,
阁下 他倒是答应了

536
00:39:55,950 --> 00:39:57,120
but as you well know,
可您也知道

537
00:39:58,370 --> 00:40:00,870
crime doesn't pay, and it's a poor showing of it we have here.
犯罪又不是什么好差事 我们这里也只有些歪瓜裂枣

538
00:40:00,950 --> 00:40:02,700
They're wretches every one of them.
哪个都是可怜虫

539
00:40:02,790 --> 00:40:03,950
I'm sorry about that.
真是抱歉

540
00:40:04,500 --> 00:40:06,120
That's a strong back. This one will do.
背很强壮 这个可以

541
00:40:42,250 --> 00:40:43,290
Come back later.
稍后再来

542
00:40:43,370 --> 00:40:44,450
Confession?
来告解？

543
00:40:46,120 --> 00:40:48,200
I was intrigued.
我很好奇

544
00:40:50,450 --> 00:40:54,750
What would such a delicate, pious creature have to confess to?
如此纤弱又虔诚的人 能有什么要告解的？

545
00:40:57,120 --> 00:41:00,540
As luck would have it, an opportunity presented itself,
真是碰巧 被我找到了一个机会

546
00:41:00,620 --> 00:41:01,620
and I…
我…

547
00:41:03,950 --> 00:41:05,660
I was about to find out.
我就要揭开谜底了

548
00:41:26,870 --> 00:41:28,700
Bless me, Father, for I have sinned.
神父 请为我祝福 我有罪

549
00:41:29,580 --> 00:41:33,250
How long has it been since your last confession, my daughter?
孩子 你多久没告解了？

550
00:41:33,330 --> 00:41:35,540
Barely a week, Father. I was in a convent.
还没到一周 神父 我在修道院待过

551
00:41:36,040 --> 00:41:37,120
A week?
就一周？

552
00:41:38,450 --> 00:41:40,580
Tsk-tsk. Have you so hastily committed sin?
你就这么轻率地犯错了？

553
00:41:40,660 --> 00:41:41,580
I have.
是的

554
00:41:42,080 --> 00:41:43,910
Sin of intent, not deed.
是罪孽的念头 并非实际行动

555
00:41:44,620 --> 00:41:46,620
-A man, is it? -Yes.
-因为一名男子 对不对？ -对

556
00:41:46,700 --> 00:41:47,950
My fiancé's brother.
是我未婚夫的兄长

557
00:41:49,500 --> 00:41:50,660
Lust?
是欲念吗？

558
00:41:50,750 --> 00:41:51,580
Hatred.
是憎恶

559
00:41:51,660 --> 00:41:52,500
Hatred…
憎恶…

560
00:41:53,450 --> 00:41:56,620
-Hatred? -The man is appalling, grotesque.
-憎恶？ -那名男子很恶劣、很丑陋

561
00:41:57,790 --> 00:41:59,290
Harsh words.
这样的话很是刺耳

562
00:41:59,370 --> 00:42:01,000
Rather uncharitable, wouldn't you say?
近乎无情了 对吗？

563
00:42:01,080 --> 00:42:03,540
Respectfully, Father, you do not know this man.
尊敬的神父 您并不了解这个人

564
00:42:03,620 --> 00:42:07,080
He tries to control and manipulate everything and everyone around him.
他试图操控周围一切的人和事

565
00:42:07,160 --> 00:42:09,790
Like every tyrant, he delights in playing the victim.
他和所有暴君一样 以假扮受害者为乐

566
00:42:09,870 --> 00:42:11,290
His only advantage, I would say,
要我说 那是他唯一的本事

567
00:42:11,370 --> 00:42:13,830
is he's far cruder than he believes himself to be.
他自以为绅士 实则粗鄙不堪

568
00:42:14,870 --> 00:42:15,870
Cruder?
粗鄙不堪？

569
00:42:16,700 --> 00:42:18,330
Uh, pray explain yourself, my child.
我的孩子 请详细说明

570
00:42:18,410 --> 00:42:21,080
For one, he's easy to spot.
比如说 他太容易被发现了

571
00:42:22,000 --> 00:42:26,290
You can see him… even on a busy street on market day.
即便是集市日的拥挤街道上 也能轻松看到他

572
00:42:32,330 --> 00:42:34,040
Tell me, how soon did you spot me?
说吧 你什么时候发现我的？

573
00:42:34,120 --> 00:42:37,040
I saw you well before you saw me, I can say that much.
只能说远比你看到我来得早

574
00:42:37,120 --> 00:42:38,160
Have you had supper?
你吃过晚饭了吗？

575
00:42:38,250 --> 00:42:40,000
I'm not that hungry, Baron. Thank you.
我还不怎么饿 男爵 谢谢

576
00:42:40,080 --> 00:42:41,540
Well, I for one am famished.
我就饿坏了

577
00:42:44,450 --> 00:42:46,540
-Thank you, my good man. -Thank you, sir.
-谢谢 好心人 -谢谢 先生

578
00:42:46,620 --> 00:42:48,910
What books did you buy, hmm? May I?
你买了什么书？能让我看看吗？

579
00:42:50,120 --> 00:42:51,120
Guess.
你猜

580
00:42:51,790 --> 00:42:53,290
-Guess? -I'd rather that you did.
-让我猜？ -还是猜一下吧

581
00:42:53,370 --> 00:42:54,290
Very well.
那好

582
00:42:58,000 --> 00:42:59,200
A romance…
言情小说

583
00:42:59,910 --> 00:43:04,160
drenched in Mediterranean sun and silk and the skirmishes of love.
沐浴着地中海的阳光 身着丝绸华服 沉醉于爱的纠葛

584
00:43:04,250 --> 00:43:06,700
Insulting, but unsurprising.
真是无礼 但也不奇怪

585
00:43:07,790 --> 00:43:08,790
Really?
是吗？

586
00:43:15,040 --> 00:43:16,160
-Insects? -Mm.
昆虫？

587
00:43:17,660 --> 00:43:20,540
My interest in science leans towards the smallest things.
我对科学的兴趣 体现在对微小生物的好奇上

588
00:43:21,200 --> 00:43:23,950
Moving with nature, perhaps the rhythms of God.
它们随自然而动 或许是顺应上帝的节律

589
00:43:25,200 --> 00:43:29,410
I've always searched for something more pure, marvelous.
我一直在寻觅 某种更纯粹、更奇妙的事物

590
00:43:33,000 --> 00:43:35,200
Is that what you were seeking in the convent?
这就是你在修道院追寻的东西吗？

591
00:43:37,910 --> 00:43:38,950
In a way.
算是吧

592
00:43:41,120 --> 00:43:42,120
Was it worth it?
值得吗？

593
00:43:43,950 --> 00:43:44,950
Is anything?
有什么是值得的吗？

594
00:43:54,120 --> 00:43:55,700
Permit me, sister.
可以吗？

595
00:44:00,200 --> 00:44:01,620
This hardly seems appropriate.
这样好像不大合适

596
00:44:02,200 --> 00:44:03,250
Is anything?
有什么是合适的吗？

597
00:44:07,830 --> 00:44:08,870
Very well.
很好

598
00:44:19,370 --> 00:44:20,580
Laughter!
笑起来！

599
00:44:23,000 --> 00:44:24,620
And for the very first time,
生平第一次

600
00:44:25,500 --> 00:44:27,620
I became more interested in life
不知何故 我对生的兴趣渐浓

601
00:44:28,200 --> 00:44:30,950
and somewhat less interested
对死的兴趣

602
00:44:31,040 --> 00:44:32,160
 in death.
减淡了

603
00:44:50,870 --> 00:44:55,290
The main rod has a fast bolting system.
主杆采用快速螺栓固定系统

604
00:44:56,000 --> 00:44:57,330
Did you use an alloy?
用合金了吗？

605
00:44:58,330 --> 00:44:59,870
Copper and zinc.
铜锌合金

606
00:44:59,950 --> 00:45:02,750
This is… This simply will not do. Start over.
这个不行 重来吧

607
00:45:03,540 --> 00:45:05,160
Pure silver is a perfect conductor.
纯银是完美的导体

608
00:45:06,910 --> 00:45:09,120
William, you must stay behind. Please.
威廉 你得留下 拜托了

609
00:45:09,200 --> 00:45:11,120
I trust you above anyone else.
我最信任的就是你了

610
00:45:11,200 --> 00:45:12,410
Only for a few more days.
再多待几天就行

611
00:45:20,250 --> 00:45:22,120
You're not going to catch her.
你抓不到它的

612
00:45:27,830 --> 00:45:30,500
Beautiful. Beautiful.
真漂亮

613
00:45:30,580 --> 00:45:32,830
-Should we trap her or let her go? -Mm…
把它关起来 还是放走呢？

614
00:45:32,910 --> 00:45:33,750
Trap her.
关起来

615
00:45:36,370 --> 00:45:38,080
Now we have something in common.
这下我们有共同点了

616
00:45:39,790 --> 00:45:40,790
A prisoner.
一个囚徒

617
00:45:41,290 --> 00:45:46,200
As promised, William took dutiful charge of the laboratory build and needs.
威廉如约行事 认真负责建造实验室 满足各种需求

618
00:45:48,370 --> 00:45:49,830
Can you fix that over there, please?
那边能修一下吗？

619
00:45:50,500 --> 00:45:51,330
Go, help.
去帮一下

620
00:45:52,450 --> 00:45:55,120
He followed my instructions to the letter.
他严格按我的指示办事

621
00:45:57,660 --> 00:45:58,700
The battery.
电池

622
00:46:07,580 --> 00:46:09,040
It's all pure silver now.
现在是纯银的了

623
00:46:09,700 --> 00:46:13,120
Conduction points corresponding to the lymphatic system,
这是和淋巴系统相对应的传导点

624
00:46:14,250 --> 00:46:18,200
which was quite complex. -But I managed.
非常复杂 但我做出来了

625
00:46:17,330 --> 00:46:19,250
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼

626
00:46:59,790 --> 00:47:03,000
Herr Harlander, thank you. The party's delightful.
哈兰德先生 谢谢 派对很精彩

627
00:47:03,080 --> 00:47:06,120
I hope we're not distracting you from your research
但愿我们没有干扰你做研究

628
00:47:07,620 --> 00:47:09,790
to tend to me and Elizabeth.
毕竟你还要顾着我和伊丽莎白

629
00:47:11,540 --> 00:47:12,540
Not at all.
完全没有

630
00:47:12,620 --> 00:47:16,000
She's young. She can count on us to guard her.
她还年轻 我们得护着她

631
00:47:19,750 --> 00:47:21,450
I shall leave you your privacy.
我还是回避一下

632
00:47:21,540 --> 00:47:23,830
No need for subterfuge between us.
我们之间还掩饰什么

633
00:47:26,290 --> 00:47:29,540
French porcelain, chimes to a man's stream.
法国陶瓷 多么美妙的共响

634
00:47:31,120 --> 00:47:35,370
I am very near a solution, an access point to the lymphatic system.
我快找到解决方法了 给淋巴系统确定传导点

635
00:47:35,450 --> 00:47:37,160
Ah, yeah, that.
哦 那个呀

636
00:47:38,000 --> 00:47:39,160
It's been so long.
这么久了

637
00:47:41,410 --> 00:47:43,120
The war is waning.
仗快打完了

638
00:47:45,040 --> 00:47:47,160
And my funding will end with it.
资金供应也快断了

639
00:47:47,250 --> 00:47:49,700
You said your funds were unlimited.
你不是说资金无限供应吗？

640
00:47:49,790 --> 00:47:51,120
My patience is not.
但我的耐心是有限的

641
00:47:52,040 --> 00:47:55,750
I have it on good authority that a battle is to take place within a week.
我得到了可靠消息 一周内会爆发一场战斗

642
00:47:57,790 --> 00:48:00,950
The tide of war will deliver its bounty to our shore.
战争好比潮水 会把战利品送到我们这条海岸上来

643
00:48:01,040 --> 00:48:03,200
A battlefield? The bodies will be mangled.
战场上的尸体肯定一塌糊涂

644
00:48:03,290 --> 00:48:04,200
One week.
就一周

645
00:48:05,120 --> 00:48:08,080
-One week? -After that, history will pass us by.
-一周？ -一周后 创造历史的机会就会溜走

646
00:48:10,660 --> 00:48:12,950
Flush that for me, will you, Baron?
帮我冲一下吧 男爵

647
00:48:15,580 --> 00:48:19,370
A week to determine how to deliver the current.
一周内找到传递电流的办法

648
00:48:19,450 --> 00:48:20,410
Impossible.
绝无可能

649
00:48:21,580 --> 00:48:22,830
What would I do?
我该怎么办？

650
00:48:22,910 --> 00:48:24,830
I was close. I could feel it.
就快成功了 我感觉得到

651
00:48:25,580 --> 00:48:29,500
And then…life got in the way.
谁知横生阻碍

652
00:48:29,580 --> 00:48:30,580
Oh.
哦

653
00:48:32,450 --> 00:48:33,870
I believe she missed you.
它肯定想你了

654
00:48:35,250 --> 00:48:37,910
I must warn you, Elizabeth, I've been working on a dissection.
伊丽莎白 我得先警告你一下 我在处理解剖体

655
00:48:38,000 --> 00:48:39,040
It's beautiful.
很美

656
00:48:41,830 --> 00:48:42,910
Does it shock you?
吓到你了吗？

657
00:48:43,870 --> 00:48:46,250
Reminds me of martyrdom paintings.
让我想起了殉道主题的绘画

658
00:48:49,700 --> 00:48:50,620
Pain is gone.
没有了痛苦

659
00:48:52,200 --> 00:48:55,370
You can see God's design in the symmetry and the shapes.
在对称的构造和形状中 看得到上帝的精妙手笔

660
00:48:57,790 --> 00:48:58,620
Elizabeth.
伊丽莎白

661
00:49:00,790 --> 00:49:02,580
I must confess something to you.
我得向你坦白

662
00:49:04,500 --> 00:49:07,580
I have a belief in the marvelous and so do you.
我相信这世间存在奇妙非凡之物 你也一样

663
00:49:09,620 --> 00:49:12,040
There is a bond between us. Can you feel it?
我们之间有种默契 你能感觉到吗？

664
00:49:12,120 --> 00:49:15,750
An almost physical one. I truly believe it to be something else.
一种近乎生理上的吸引 我坚信这种感觉绝非寻常

665
00:49:24,040 --> 00:49:26,200
Believing something does not make it true.
你所信之物 未必是事实

666
00:49:30,370 --> 00:49:31,580
Then why are you here?
那你为什么来这里？

667
00:49:39,160 --> 00:49:41,250
Beautiful creature, is she not?
它很美 对不对？

668
00:49:43,080 --> 00:49:47,330
Remote. Entirely bewitching, but so odd.
孤傲 令人沉迷 却又如此怪异

669
00:49:53,080 --> 00:49:54,160
Three hearts.
有三颗心

670
00:49:55,120 --> 00:49:56,910
Multiple eyes. White blood.
复眼 白色的血

671
00:49:59,000 --> 00:50:01,370
And a fascinating lack of choice.
它无法做出选择 所以如此迷人

672
00:50:01,950 --> 00:50:03,080
I don't understand.
我不明白

673
00:50:04,450 --> 00:50:06,330
Choice is the seat of the soul.
有选择的能力 灵魂才能栖息

674
00:50:09,040 --> 00:50:10,950
The one gift God granted us.
这是上帝对我们的赠礼

675
00:50:16,120 --> 00:50:17,200
Elizabeth…
伊丽莎白

676
00:50:21,540 --> 00:50:22,540
I have chosen.
我做出选择了

677
00:50:23,040 --> 00:50:24,120
Good night.
晚安

678
00:50:30,790 --> 00:50:31,750
Elizabeth!
伊丽莎白！

679
00:50:35,040 --> 00:50:35,870
Elizabeth!
伊丽莎白！

680
00:50:40,410 --> 00:50:41,660
I thought I had failed.
我以为我失败了

681
00:50:43,250 --> 00:50:45,500
I thought it was entirely over. I thought…
以为一切都完了 以为…

682
00:50:46,950 --> 00:50:48,000
And I thought…
我以为…

683
00:50:49,160 --> 00:50:50,000
And I…
我…

684
00:50:50,950 --> 00:50:52,250
The symmetry.
对称性

685
00:50:58,620 --> 00:51:00,750
God's symmetry. Yes, yes.
上帝创造的对称性 对

686
00:51:14,120 --> 00:51:15,000
Yes.
找到了

687
00:51:29,250 --> 00:51:31,540
Placing the battery above the lymphatic system.
把电池放在淋巴系统上

688
00:51:32,160 --> 00:51:33,950
I had found the key.
我就这么找到了解题的关键

689
00:51:34,660 --> 00:51:36,410
Nothing could stop me now.
再也没有什么能阻挡我了

690
00:51:38,620 --> 00:51:39,540
Nothing.
没有

691
00:51:42,410 --> 00:51:44,540
No! No, do not take any bodies
别动！这堆尸体

692
00:51:44,620 --> 00:51:47,790
from the top or the bottom of the pile unless I mark them.
顶上的和底部的都别搬 就搬我做了标记的

693
00:51:47,870 --> 00:51:50,080
Ice or rot may have destroyed the tissue.
冰冻或腐败可能会破坏组织

694
00:51:50,950 --> 00:51:52,160
Look only in the middle.
就看中间的那些

695
00:51:58,750 --> 00:52:02,620
Abundance can be disorienting unless one hones one's aim.
东西太多 会让人晕头转向 除非目标非常明确

696
00:52:02,700 --> 00:52:05,450
I'm favoring tall specimens, long limbs.
我想要个子高的 长手长脚的

697
00:52:05,540 --> 00:52:07,290
Scale will make the work easier.
划定范围 活就好干了

698
00:52:07,370 --> 00:52:08,330
I like that.
我喜欢

699
00:52:10,330 --> 00:52:11,330
Perfection.
尽善尽美嘛

700
00:52:12,370 --> 00:52:14,200
And why not, dear Baron?
有什么不好呢 亲爱的男爵？

701
00:52:15,790 --> 00:52:17,120
Indeed, why not?
确实 有什么不好呢？

702
00:52:17,830 --> 00:52:19,450
Look for a head that's intact.
找到完整的人头

703
00:52:20,790 --> 00:52:21,830
Put that one in the cart.
搬到车上去

704
00:52:27,160 --> 00:52:28,370
Set that one over there.
那个放那边

705
00:52:28,870 --> 00:52:29,910
Bring the others.
其他的送过来

706
00:52:35,950 --> 00:52:36,870
Oh, good God.
老天

707
00:53:50,790 --> 00:53:51,910
Do you mind?
劳驾

708
00:55:19,250 --> 00:55:20,620
It is finished.
大功告成

709
00:56:05,620 --> 00:56:06,830
Herr Harlander!
哈兰德先生！

710
00:56:07,910 --> 00:56:09,200
A storm is coming!
暴风雨要来了！

711
00:56:12,040 --> 00:56:12,870
My cane.
我的拐杖

712
00:56:14,370 --> 00:56:15,200
My cane!
我的拐杖！

713
00:56:15,790 --> 00:56:17,120
My cane, in the handle.
我的拐杖 手柄打开

714
00:56:26,790 --> 00:56:27,700
Mercury.
水银

715
00:56:27,790 --> 00:56:29,500
-Are you ill? -Thank you.
-你病了吗？ -谢谢

716
00:56:40,540 --> 00:56:42,580
Is it… syphilis?
是梅毒吗？

717
00:56:45,370 --> 00:56:46,540
Yeah, I'm dying.
对 我快死了

718
00:56:48,700 --> 00:56:51,700
One night with Venus, a lifetime with Mercury.
一夜偷欢 终生服毒

719
00:56:51,790 --> 00:56:52,910
Isn't that the phrase?
是这么说的吧？

720
00:56:53,660 --> 00:56:54,700
What stage?
几期了？

721
00:56:54,790 --> 00:56:55,620
Secondary?
二期？

722
00:56:55,700 --> 00:56:57,830
We both know the precise schedule.
你我都清楚会怎么发展

723
00:56:58,330 --> 00:57:00,620
It starts to eat away my bones,
已经在啃噬我的骨头了

724
00:57:00,700 --> 00:57:06,330
orbital, cheek, teeth, jaw, skull, exposing my brain.
眼眶、脸颊、牙齿、下颌、颅骨 层层侵蚀 直到抵达大脑

725
00:57:06,410 --> 00:57:10,160
Tumors, madness, excruciating pain.
长瘤、发狂、剧痛

726
00:57:11,370 --> 00:57:15,910
One fine morning, I will start to scream and I will never stop.
到某个清晨 我会开始尖叫 停不下来

727
00:57:16,830 --> 00:57:19,750
I cannot face such a vulgar demise.
我无法接受如此不堪地死去

728
00:57:20,450 --> 00:57:23,160
Which brings me to my one condition.
于是我想到了我唯一的要求

729
00:57:23,250 --> 00:57:27,200
Our deal. As agreed, in exchange
我们约定好的交易

730
00:57:27,290 --> 00:57:29,950
for my generous intervention on your behalf.
我为你慷慨解囊所能换取的东西

731
00:57:31,450 --> 00:57:34,790
And as we give life to our new Adam,
既然我们即将造出新人类

732
00:57:35,370 --> 00:57:37,830
I want to be placed in this new perfect body.
我想要拥有这具完美新身体

733
00:57:40,370 --> 00:57:41,500
No.
不行

734
00:57:43,410 --> 00:57:44,950
-No, no. -Yes.
-不可以 -当然可以

735
00:57:45,040 --> 00:57:46,910
Not now. Not now!
还没到时候！

736
00:57:47,000 --> 00:57:49,910
-Precisely now. -We'll talk about this after, not now.
-正是这时候 -这事我们以后再聊 现在不行

737
00:57:50,000 --> 00:57:51,040
There is no after!
哪还有什么以后！

738
00:57:52,830 --> 00:57:54,200
There is no after.
没有以后了

739
00:58:40,040 --> 00:58:42,040
I gave you everything you wanted!
你要的一切 我都给你了！

740
00:58:42,120 --> 00:58:44,290
I give you everything you ask for.
你要什么 我都给你

741
00:58:44,370 --> 00:58:45,750
Name it, it's yours.
随你说

742
00:58:46,870 --> 00:58:48,000
Even Elizabeth.
你要伊丽莎白都行

743
00:58:50,040 --> 00:58:51,040
Please.
求你了

744
00:58:52,200 --> 00:58:53,620
"Please" always helps.
礼貌一点总有效果

745
00:58:54,750 --> 00:58:57,450
The disease has spread all inside of you.
你已经病入膏肓了

746
00:58:57,540 --> 00:58:59,660
It's systemic, and you know it.
这是全身性疾病 你知道的

747
00:58:59,750 --> 00:59:01,700
Every organ in you is polluted.
你的每个器官都感染了

748
00:59:01,790 --> 00:59:03,870
Your brain, your blood, it's all polluted.
大脑 血液 全都感染了

749
00:59:03,950 --> 00:59:05,500
But my money's not, is that it?
但我还有钱啊 对不对？

750
00:59:05,580 --> 00:59:06,580
It's impossible.
无济于事

751
00:59:09,410 --> 00:59:12,250
Now, all you need to say is one simple word.
我只要你说一个“行”字

752
00:59:12,790 --> 00:59:14,540
"Yes," no more and no less.
别的什么都不要说

753
00:59:14,620 --> 00:59:16,450
No! Do you understand? No!
不行！听明白了吗？不行！

754
00:59:28,200 --> 00:59:29,330
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

755
00:59:29,830 --> 00:59:30,700
Stop!
住手！

756
00:59:31,500 --> 00:59:32,500
Stop.
住手

757
00:59:32,580 --> 00:59:34,950
If we lose that, we have nothing. We both lose.
没了这个 我们就一无所有了 我们俩都会完蛋

758
00:59:35,040 --> 00:59:37,750
I will be the eagle that feasts on your liver!
普罗米修斯 我就是啄食你肝脏的鹰！

759
00:59:37,830 --> 00:59:38,910
Please, stop!
求你了 住手！

760
00:59:39,410 --> 00:59:41,160
Herr Harlander. Herr Harlander!
哈兰德先生！

761
00:59:50,040 --> 00:59:51,290
Hold on, look at me!
坚持住 看着我！

762
00:59:54,200 --> 00:59:56,370
No! Herr Harlander!
不！哈兰德先生

763
01:00:31,700 --> 01:00:34,450
No, no. No!
不要啊

764
01:02:06,750 --> 01:02:08,080
No, no, no!
不！

765
01:02:08,700 --> 01:02:09,540
No!
不！

766
01:02:24,370 --> 01:02:28,500
No! No! No!
不！

767
01:02:38,580 --> 01:02:40,120
You lied to me.
你骗了我

768
01:02:42,330 --> 01:02:43,370
You lied.
骗了我

769
01:02:51,330 --> 01:02:52,250
Victor!
维克多！

770
01:02:53,750 --> 01:02:54,580
Victor!
维克多！

771
01:03:33,410 --> 01:03:34,790
No, please.
别过来 求你了

772
01:04:01,120 --> 01:04:03,250
Look. Same.
看 一样的

773
01:04:14,080 --> 01:04:14,950
Sun.
太阳

774
01:04:16,080 --> 01:04:17,370
Sun. Light.
阳光

775
01:04:20,330 --> 01:04:21,370
Face it.
去感受一下

776
01:04:22,040 --> 01:04:24,250
Sunlight. The sun is…
阳光 太阳…

777
01:04:24,330 --> 01:04:25,830
The sun is life.
太阳是生命之源

778
01:04:28,410 --> 01:04:29,750
Ah, the warmth. Huh?
很温暖

779
01:04:30,540 --> 01:04:32,290
Yes! Yes.
没错

780
01:04:41,700 --> 01:04:42,910
Victor.
维克多

781
01:04:44,870 --> 01:04:45,830
Victor.
维克多

782
01:04:49,700 --> 01:04:51,290
-Victor. -Yes.
-维克多 -对

783
01:04:52,080 --> 01:04:54,660
Yes, yes, yes. Of course you are.
对 你就是

784
01:04:55,370 --> 01:04:56,450
Of course you are.
你当然就是

785
01:05:02,000 --> 01:05:03,620
Victor.
维克多

786
01:05:10,500 --> 01:05:11,500
The mail, sir.
邮件来了

787
01:05:12,040 --> 01:05:13,500
Letters from the old estate.
老庄园来的信

788
01:05:14,000 --> 01:05:15,000
Geneva.
日内瓦

789
01:05:15,830 --> 01:05:17,910
-Is there anything from my uncle? -No.
-有我叔叔的来信吗？ -没有

790
01:05:23,160 --> 01:05:24,950
Perhaps we should pay them a visit.
或许我们该去拜访一下他们了

791
01:05:28,370 --> 01:05:30,290
Careful. Look. Look down.
小心 看着脚下

792
01:05:32,330 --> 01:05:34,500
Water. Water.
水

793
01:05:36,910 --> 01:05:37,870
Water.
水

794
01:05:37,950 --> 01:05:39,660
Yes, water.
对 水

795
01:05:39,750 --> 01:05:41,080
-Victor. -No, I'm Victor.
-维克多 -不 我是维克多

796
01:05:41,160 --> 01:05:42,500
That's water. Come here.
这是水 来这里

797
01:05:42,580 --> 01:05:44,330
-Victor. -Come now, come. All right, good.
-维克多 -来吧 很好

798
01:05:44,410 --> 01:05:46,080
We're going to take a big step.
要跨一大步

799
01:05:46,160 --> 01:05:47,410
We'll do it together. Ready?
我们一起来 准备好了？

800
01:05:47,500 --> 01:05:49,200
This way, like this.
-走这边 这样 -维克多

801
01:05:49,830 --> 01:05:52,080
No, not like that. This way.
不是那样 走这边

802
01:05:52,660 --> 01:05:54,250
Oh, no, no, no. Hot, hot.
别碰 烫

803
01:05:54,750 --> 01:05:56,250
No, don't touch. Don't touch that.
不能碰 别碰它

804
01:05:56,330 --> 01:05:57,290
It's hot.
烫

805
01:06:04,160 --> 01:06:06,830
Sit. Very good. Very good. Yes.
坐下 很好 真棒

806
01:06:08,660 --> 01:06:10,910
Yes. Now, look what I have here.
好 看这是什么

807
01:06:11,000 --> 01:06:12,750
Look at this. What is this thing?
看这个 这是什么？

808
01:06:12,830 --> 01:06:14,950
What is this strange thing? Careful.
这个怪东西是什么？当心

809
01:06:16,330 --> 01:06:17,290
You're very strong.
你力气很大

810
01:06:17,370 --> 01:06:19,540
Yes. And like this. Huh?
好了 这样

811
01:06:20,500 --> 01:06:24,200
Yes, you want another? Yes, this one goes right here.
还想要那个？好 这个放这里

812
01:06:24,290 --> 01:06:25,160
Key.
钥匙

813
01:06:26,290 --> 01:06:27,410
Victor.
维克多

814
01:06:30,330 --> 01:06:32,200
This will keep you nice and warm.
这样你就不会着凉了

815
01:06:32,290 --> 01:06:34,000
Nice blanket to keep you warm.
披上一条好毯子 暖暖的

816
01:06:34,540 --> 01:06:36,080
-Victor. 
维克多

817
01:06:36,160 --> 01:06:37,370
All right.
好了

818
01:06:38,540 --> 01:06:39,450
You stay.
你待在这里

819
01:06:40,370 --> 01:06:41,910
You stay here now.
就待在这里

820
01:06:44,540 --> 01:06:45,910
Stay here now.
待着别动

821
01:06:46,750 --> 01:06:48,450
I'll be back. All right. Stay there.
我去去就回 待着别动

822
01:06:51,330 --> 01:06:52,370
Victor.
维克多

823
01:06:53,450 --> 01:06:56,410
No, no, no, no, no. It's all right.
别动 没事的

824
01:06:57,080 --> 01:06:58,080
I'll come back.
我会回来的

825
01:07:05,000 --> 01:07:06,120
Victor.
维克多

826
01:07:07,500 --> 01:07:08,370
Victor.
维克多

827
01:07:09,450 --> 01:07:11,410
Everything was new to him.
对他来说 一切都是新的

828
01:07:12,500 --> 01:07:16,750
Warmth, cold, light, darkness.
温暖、冰冷、阳光、黑暗

829
01:07:17,540 --> 01:07:19,540
And I was there to mold him.
我的任务是塑造他

830
01:07:21,080 --> 01:07:23,290
I never considered what would come after creation.
造成之后的事 我还从未考虑过

831
01:07:24,700 --> 01:07:26,950
And having reached the edge of the earth,
来到世界尽头

832
01:07:28,120 --> 01:07:29,700
there was no horizon left.
才发现没有地平线

833
01:07:33,450 --> 01:07:35,870
The achievement felt unnatural.
如此成就有种非自然的感觉

834
01:07:39,790 --> 01:07:41,950
Void of meaning.
并无意义

835
01:07:44,580 --> 01:07:46,370
And this troubled me so.
这让我十分烦恼

836
01:07:47,660 --> 01:07:49,910
Your men, they wish to go back.
船员们都想回去

837
01:07:50,000 --> 01:07:50,830
Yes?
对吗？

838
01:07:51,450 --> 01:07:52,330
Probably.
可能吧

839
01:07:54,700 --> 01:07:57,080
But the moment we're free, we're setting sails forwards.
不过一旦船能开动 我们就会继续前行

840
01:07:57,160 --> 01:07:58,450
No matter the cost.
不管付出什么代价

841
01:07:58,540 --> 01:08:00,040
You share my madness.
你简直和我一样疯狂

842
01:08:02,910 --> 01:08:06,160
Perhaps there is a finer point in me telling you my story.
我向你讲述自己的故事 或许别有深意

843
01:08:06,250 --> 01:08:08,290
Whether there is or isn't, Baron…
男爵 不管是否如此

844
01:08:11,120 --> 01:08:12,200
I'd like to hear it.
我都愿意听

845
01:08:14,450 --> 01:08:16,290
Weeks passed,
几周过去了

846
01:08:16,370 --> 01:08:20,080
and as his strength increased rapidly, mine waned.
他的力量迅速增强 我却日渐衰弱

847
01:08:20,700 --> 01:08:24,160
Alas, no further language or development occurred.
可惜他没学会更多的话 也没有别的进展

848
01:08:25,120 --> 01:08:26,830
No, no, no, no, no, no.
不对

849
01:08:27,830 --> 01:08:30,080
Down, down, down, down.
低头

850
01:08:30,620 --> 01:08:31,540
Yes, there we are.
这就对了

851
01:08:32,040 --> 01:08:33,830
There we are. Stay there. Stay.
可以了 别动

852
01:08:37,200 --> 01:08:38,200
Yes, that's you.
这就是你

853
01:08:38,910 --> 01:08:40,580
That's you. All right?
这是你 知道了吗？

854
01:08:46,700 --> 01:08:48,620
Oh, yes, this is healing rather nicely.
愈合得很好

855
01:08:50,660 --> 01:08:51,750
I'm tired.
我累了

856
01:08:53,870 --> 01:08:55,330
I have not slept.
我好久没睡了

857
01:08:56,830 --> 01:09:00,950
Not a winky-dinky-doo of sleep for me.
一点都没睡

858
01:09:01,500 --> 01:09:02,330
Tending to you.
一直在照顾你

859
01:09:03,910 --> 01:09:05,330
I've finished shaving you.
终于给你脸上刮干净了

860
01:09:10,660 --> 01:09:12,500
No, no, stop, stop.
不行 别动

861
01:09:12,580 --> 01:09:14,910
Let go. No, no, no, no, no, no. Open.
放下 不可以 松开

862
01:09:15,000 --> 01:09:17,080
Open your hand. Open. Open it.
手松开 快松开

863
01:09:21,120 --> 01:09:22,330
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

864
01:09:23,160 --> 01:09:24,660
Look. Look what you've done.
看看你都干了什么

865
01:09:24,750 --> 01:09:27,330
You have to listen to me. You have to listen. I said drop it.
你要听我的话 我说了放下

866
01:09:28,500 --> 01:09:31,290
Stupidity! No. Stop.
真蠢！不 别这样

867
01:09:32,250 --> 01:09:33,080
Come here.
来

868
01:09:33,160 --> 01:09:35,580
-Victor. -No, don't touch me!
-维克多 -不 别碰我！

869
01:09:35,660 --> 01:09:37,080
Don't ever touch me!
永远都别碰我！

870
01:09:44,120 --> 01:09:44,950
Come here.
来吧

871
01:09:46,160 --> 01:09:47,830
I didn't do this. You did this.
不是我 是你自己弄的

872
01:09:53,200 --> 01:09:54,290
The wound.
伤口

873
01:09:55,540 --> 01:09:56,540
It's closed.
闭合了

874
01:09:57,250 --> 01:09:58,080
But how?
怎么会的

875
01:10:01,750 --> 01:10:02,790
All right.
好了

876
01:10:06,160 --> 01:10:07,160
No, no, no.
不行

877
01:10:08,660 --> 01:10:09,660
No.
别动

878
01:10:11,620 --> 01:10:12,790
No.
别动

879
01:10:14,200 --> 01:10:16,830
All right. All right.
好了

880
01:10:23,660 --> 01:10:25,290
I'm sure everything's all right.
肯定一切都好

881
01:10:28,080 --> 01:10:29,580
We'll be there soon enough.
很快就到了

882
01:10:31,870 --> 01:10:33,790
I know you have thoughts. I know.
我知道你有想法 我知道

883
01:10:33,870 --> 01:10:35,040
I know you do.
我知道你有

884
01:10:35,120 --> 01:10:37,580
Somewhere in there. Somewhere in there you have thoughts.
就在这里面 你有想法

885
01:10:38,790 --> 01:10:39,790
Hmm? Don't you?
是不是？

886
01:10:40,450 --> 01:10:41,790
Something you might want to say?
你想说什么吗？

887
01:10:41,870 --> 01:10:43,870
However jumbled, however confused?
虽然脑子里很乱、很困惑

888
01:10:44,790 --> 01:10:45,620
Hmm? Something?
有想法吗？

889
01:10:46,410 --> 01:10:47,540
Am I presuming too much?
还是我太心急了？

890
01:10:47,620 --> 01:10:48,660
Victor.
维克多

891
01:10:48,750 --> 01:10:51,790
Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes!
知道了！

892
01:10:51,870 --> 01:10:53,750
This much we have established.
这个已经教会你了

893
01:10:53,830 --> 01:10:56,040
That is my name. My name is Victor.
那是我的名字 我的名字是维克多

894
01:10:56,120 --> 01:10:58,450
Is there anything else that you can say? Anything at all? Hmm?
你还能说点别的吗？什么都可以

895
01:11:00,700 --> 01:11:01,910
Anything? Anything?
有吗？

896
01:11:02,830 --> 01:11:03,950
Um, sun, hmm?
太阳

897
01:11:04,790 --> 01:11:08,910
Cold. Rain. Blood. Anything.
冷、雨、血 任何东西

898
01:11:09,000 --> 01:11:10,870
Boot. Can you say "boot"?
靴子 靴子会说吗？

899
01:11:11,700 --> 01:11:12,580
Victor.
维克多

900
01:11:14,250 --> 01:11:17,160
No, yes, no, yes! How about…
够了！那么…

901
01:11:17,250 --> 01:11:18,950
How about "hand"? Can you say "hand"?
手呢？手会说吗？

902
01:11:19,040 --> 01:11:20,750
Hand. Hand.
手 说啊…

903
01:11:25,870 --> 01:11:27,330
Oh. Oh, oh. You are afraid of me?
你这是怕我吗？

904
01:11:28,620 --> 01:11:30,250
You're afraid of me?
你怕我？

905
01:11:30,330 --> 01:11:32,580
Why? Why would you be afraid of me?
为什么？为什么你会怕我？

906
01:11:32,660 --> 01:11:34,040
I'm not going to hurt you.
我不会伤害你的

907
01:11:34,700 --> 01:11:36,410
I'm not going to hurt you. I made you.
我不会伤害你的 是我造了你

908
01:11:37,000 --> 01:11:38,290
I'm your maker! Stop it!
是我造了你！别这样了！

909
01:11:56,450 --> 01:11:58,290
You're here. You're really here.
你们来了 真的来了

910
01:11:59,160 --> 01:12:00,870
Come on, then. Come, come.
来吧 快进来

911
01:12:02,410 --> 01:12:04,910
I have to tell you. I have so much to show you, Elizabeth.
伊丽莎白 我得说 我有好多东西要给你看

912
01:12:05,000 --> 01:12:06,910
You won't believe it. It's absolutely marvelous.
特别奇妙 你都不敢相信

913
01:12:07,000 --> 01:12:08,660
Come, come, I'll show you my notes first.
快来 先给你看我的笔记

914
01:12:08,750 --> 01:12:10,200
Is my uncle here?
我叔叔在这里吗？

915
01:12:11,000 --> 01:12:11,870
What?
什么？

916
01:12:12,660 --> 01:12:13,870
My uncle, is he here?
我叔叔 他在这里吗？

917
01:12:13,950 --> 01:12:14,830
No, no.
不在

918
01:12:15,370 --> 01:12:17,080
No, I'm alone. He's not here.
这里就我一个人 他不在

919
01:12:17,160 --> 01:12:20,000
-He's… He'll be back in a few days. -You don't look very well, Victor.
-他…他几天后会回来 -维克多 你看着状态不大好

920
01:12:20,080 --> 01:12:22,830
Oh, I've never felt better! I've never had a clearer mind! Come, come!
我的状态从来没这么好过！ 我的头脑清晰多了！快来！

921
01:12:23,330 --> 01:12:24,540
Are you running a fever?
你发烧了吗？

922
01:12:25,330 --> 01:12:27,080
I am just very excited to see you.
我只是看到你太激动了

923
01:12:27,620 --> 01:12:30,000
I'm exalted. The spirits have lifted me so much.
我太高兴了 简直要飞起来了

924
01:12:30,080 --> 01:12:32,250
Absolutely marvelous…
那东西太神奇了 我就知道能实现

925
01:12:32,790 --> 01:12:34,410
Victor…
维克多

926
01:12:36,330 --> 01:12:39,450
Victor. Victor.
维克多 请给我一点时间

927
01:14:53,500 --> 01:14:54,870
Who hurt you?
是谁伤害了你？

928
01:14:55,750 --> 01:14:57,500
I have to show you this, William.
威廉 你一定要看看这个

929
01:14:58,540 --> 01:15:00,040
Let me organize it for you.
我先整理一下

930
01:15:00,120 --> 01:15:02,330
And I have something to show to you.
我也有东西要给你看

931
01:15:04,040 --> 01:15:06,000
I've spoken to the Royal Medical Society.
我跟英国皇家医学会的人聊过了

932
01:15:06,700 --> 01:15:09,160
-They're interested in seeing you. -No, no, no, not yet.
-他们想见你 -现在还不行

933
01:15:09,830 --> 01:15:11,080
I'm not quite ready yet.
我还没准备好

934
01:15:12,330 --> 01:15:14,410
I thought that's what you always wanted.
我以为这是你一直以来的梦想

935
01:15:18,410 --> 01:15:19,540
The man.
那个男人

936
01:15:20,500 --> 01:15:22,200
-The man downstairs. -You saw him?
-楼下的那个男人 -你看到他了？

937
01:15:22,910 --> 01:15:25,160
Is he a patient? A victim?
他是病人吗？是被你打伤的吗？

938
01:15:27,080 --> 01:15:29,200
His wounds. You wounded him like that.
他身上好多伤口 你竟然下手那么重

939
01:15:29,290 --> 01:15:32,000
No, no, no. It was the world that hurt him, Elizabeth.
不 伤害他的是这个世界 伊丽莎白

940
01:15:32,080 --> 01:15:33,790
I… I gave him life.
我给了他生命

941
01:15:35,410 --> 01:15:36,620
I gave him life.
我给了他生命

942
01:15:39,000 --> 01:15:40,040
Up, up, up.
起来

943
01:15:40,870 --> 01:15:41,870
Come on.
来

944
01:15:43,830 --> 01:15:45,250
There, there, there…
慢着

945
01:15:45,330 --> 01:15:47,540
He's still getting used to his surroundings.
他还在适应周围的环境

946
01:15:51,120 --> 01:15:53,160
It is strong, William.
它很强壮 威廉

947
01:15:53,250 --> 01:15:55,120
-You did it. -It's so strong.
-你成功了 -非常强壮

948
01:15:55,790 --> 01:15:56,750
You did it.
你成功了

949
01:15:57,330 --> 01:15:59,290
All its systems are functional.
体内所有系统都正常运作

950
01:15:59,370 --> 01:16:00,330
All healing.
伤口都在愈合

951
01:16:01,790 --> 01:16:04,580
And the healing is erratic, yes.
愈合的状态不稳定

952
01:16:05,080 --> 01:16:06,500
But exceptional.
但是非同寻常

953
01:16:14,410 --> 01:16:16,120
Why is he chained here?
他为什么被拴在这里？

954
01:16:16,200 --> 01:16:17,870
For his own safety and for mine,
为了保护他自己 还有我

955
01:16:17,950 --> 01:16:21,620
and it's easy to clean and, uh, maintain it.
也更方便给它清洁维护

956
01:16:21,700 --> 01:16:23,120
And it doesn't know any better.
很多事它还不懂

957
01:16:24,500 --> 01:16:25,500
But you do.
但你懂

958
01:16:28,700 --> 01:16:29,910
Does Harlander know?
哈兰德知道了吗？

959
01:16:32,370 --> 01:16:35,000
We have to prepare everything for the moment he returns.
我们要在他回来之前把一切准备好…

960
01:16:35,080 --> 01:16:37,250
-Of course. -And have everything presentable.
-当然 -…让一切都有模有样

961
01:16:40,750 --> 01:16:42,500
Is it intelligent?
它有智慧吗？

962
01:16:46,370 --> 01:16:48,330
Victor, is it intelligent?
维克多 它有智慧吗？

963
01:17:02,620 --> 01:17:05,250
I can't fathom how exactly you did what you did,
我无法理解你是怎么做到的

964
01:17:05,830 --> 01:17:07,750
but its dimension does not escape me.
但这无疑是一项壮举

965
01:17:10,290 --> 01:17:14,000
Victor, did you ever ask yourself,
维克多 你有没有问过自己

966
01:17:15,040 --> 01:17:16,910
of all the parts that make that man,
这个人的所有组成部分中

967
01:17:17,830 --> 01:17:19,830
which one holds the soul?
哪块是灵魂藏身的地方？

968
01:17:26,450 --> 01:17:27,950
No, I didn't.
我没问过

969
01:17:28,580 --> 01:17:32,040
There's something so disquieting about that creature down there.
楼下那头怪物总让人感到不安

970
01:17:33,200 --> 01:17:36,500
Askew, like a figure peeking around a funhouse mirror.
扭曲诡异 像个在哈哈镜里探头探脑的身影

971
01:17:37,200 --> 01:17:38,450
But animated.
但很有活力

972
01:17:39,290 --> 01:17:40,450
Animated by what?
是哪里来的活力？

973
01:18:45,330 --> 01:18:46,370
Does it hurt?
痛吗？

974
01:18:54,500 --> 01:18:55,450
A leaf?
叶子？

975
01:18:55,950 --> 01:18:56,950
For me?
给我的吗？

976
01:18:57,830 --> 01:18:58,950
Thank you.
谢谢

977
01:19:03,040 --> 01:19:04,370
Isn't it beautiful?
是不是很美？

978
01:19:05,870 --> 01:19:06,830
This is for me?
给我的吗？

979
01:19:08,580 --> 01:19:09,620
I'm Elizabeth.
我是伊丽莎白

980
01:19:11,620 --> 01:19:13,120
Can you say "Elizabeth"?
会说吗？伊丽莎白

981
01:19:14,290 --> 01:19:15,330
Elizabeth.
伊丽莎白

982
01:19:16,620 --> 01:19:19,160
My throat makes sounds.
从喉咙里发出声音

983
01:19:19,750 --> 01:19:20,830
Elizabeth.
伊丽莎白

984
01:19:37,750 --> 01:19:38,910
I'm going to go now.
我要走了

985
01:19:53,750 --> 01:19:56,950
Eliza… beth.
伊丽莎…白

986
01:19:58,830 --> 01:20:00,580
You should not go near it.
你不该靠近那东西的

987
01:20:02,660 --> 01:20:03,540
"It"?
那东西？

988
01:20:05,660 --> 01:20:07,660
It. Yes.
没错 那东西

989
01:20:08,250 --> 01:20:12,370
I believe there is life in it, but not the spark of intelligence 
那东西是活的 但没有智慧的火花

990
01:20:12,450 --> 01:20:13,450
that I had intended.
我故意这么设计的

991
01:20:13,540 --> 01:20:15,160
Perhaps not as you understand it.
可能不是你想象的那样

992
01:20:15,250 --> 01:20:16,870
Something went wrong.
什么地方出了差错

993
01:20:16,950 --> 01:20:19,370
A blockage, a suture, a connection.
阻塞了 缝合了 连通了

994
01:20:19,450 --> 01:20:21,950
You, the great Victor Frankenstein, you made a mistake?
伟大的维克多·弗兰肯斯坦 还会犯错？

995
01:20:22,040 --> 01:20:24,250
The Creature knows but one word, and one word alone.
那头怪物只会一个词 仅有的一个

996
01:20:24,330 --> 01:20:26,290
"Victor, Victor, Victor, Victor."
维克多

997
01:20:26,370 --> 01:20:28,870
It just parrots it without rhyme or reason.
只是莫名其妙地机械重复

998
01:20:28,950 --> 01:20:31,950
Perhaps for the time being that word means everything to him.
也许在当下 那个词就是他的一切

999
01:20:32,040 --> 01:20:35,370
What if in being anew, the spirit that animates him is simpler,
要是重生后的他 获得活力的源泉其实更简单

1000
01:20:35,450 --> 01:20:36,580
-purer-- -Purer?
-更纯粹… -纯粹？

1001
01:20:36,660 --> 01:20:38,540
Purer than that of the common man?
比普通人的更纯粹呢？

1002
01:20:43,290 --> 01:20:44,950
What if, unrestrained by sin,
要是他不受制于原罪

1003
01:20:45,040 --> 01:20:47,870
our creator's breath came into its wounded flesh directly?
而造物主为这具伤痕累累的血肉之躯 直接注入了生气呢？

1004
01:20:47,950 --> 01:20:50,080
Good God, Elizabeth.
天啊 伊丽莎白

1005
01:20:51,910 --> 01:20:54,040
If I could force myself to believe it,
要是我强迫自己信了你这话

1006
01:20:54,120 --> 01:20:58,160
it would be my inclination to see attraction in you for that thing.
我会觉得你是不是被这东西吸引了

1007
01:20:58,250 --> 01:20:59,620
Understanding.
好好理解一下

1008
01:21:00,620 --> 01:21:01,910
In those eyes I saw pain,
他的眼中有痛苦的情绪

1009
01:21:02,000 --> 01:21:04,040
and what is pain if not evidence of intelligence?
没有智慧 何来痛苦？

1010
01:21:04,120 --> 01:21:05,250
What about my pain?
那我的痛苦算什么？

1011
01:21:05,910 --> 01:21:07,450
What about what you have denied me?
被你拒绝算什么？

1012
01:21:08,910 --> 01:21:10,500
What my heart wants…
我的心想要什么？

1013
01:21:11,870 --> 01:21:12,910
Your heart?
你的心？

1014
01:21:16,330 --> 01:21:17,660
Of all the human anatomy,
所有人体结构中

1015
01:21:17,750 --> 01:21:20,330
that is the organ furthest from your understanding.
只有心最难捉摸

1016
01:21:21,330 --> 01:21:23,290
Only monsters play God, Baron.
男爵 只有怪物会扮演上帝

1017
01:21:29,250 --> 01:21:31,250
Purer than the common man, hmm?
比普通人更纯粹

1018
01:21:36,540 --> 01:21:38,700
And I, somehow, the villain. Mm-hmm.
不知怎的 我成了坏人

1019
01:21:40,870 --> 01:21:42,620
Your heart is pure?
你的心很纯粹？

1020
01:21:43,370 --> 01:21:44,910
I assure you it isn't.
我向你保证 并非如此

1021
01:21:45,410 --> 01:21:47,120
I should know. I put it there.
我知道 因为是我亲手放进去的

1022
01:21:47,620 --> 01:21:48,450
Up.
上去

1023
01:21:59,790 --> 01:22:00,950
Let us try again.
再试一下

1024
01:22:04,200 --> 01:22:05,290
Now give me your leg.
腿伸出来

1025
01:22:06,160 --> 01:22:07,000
Leg!
腿！

1026
01:22:08,500 --> 01:22:09,500
Give me your leg!
腿伸出来！

1027
01:22:10,370 --> 01:22:12,750
Pain is evidence of intelligence, is it not?
没有智慧 何来痛苦？

1028
01:22:13,330 --> 01:22:14,790
Well, let's test the theory.
行 测试一下这个说法吧

1029
01:22:15,620 --> 01:22:17,450
Give me your leg!
腿伸出来！

1030
01:22:18,200 --> 01:22:19,120
Leg!
腿！

1031
01:22:20,080 --> 01:22:21,000
Leg!
腿！

1032
01:22:21,080 --> 01:22:22,290
Come on!
快点！

1033
01:22:22,950 --> 01:22:24,160
Give it to me, you beast!
伸出来 你个野兽！

1034
01:22:25,830 --> 01:22:28,330
Give me your leg!
腿伸出来！

1035
01:22:30,040 --> 01:22:31,040
Leg!
腿！

1036
01:22:34,620 --> 01:22:35,700
Victor!
维克多！

1037
01:22:37,250 --> 01:22:38,910
Victor!
维克多！

1038
01:22:41,370 --> 01:22:43,200
Victor!
维克多！

1039
01:22:43,290 --> 01:22:46,290
Victor! Victor!
维克多！

1040
01:22:46,910 --> 01:22:47,950
What is it, Victor?
维克多 怎么了？

1041
01:22:49,290 --> 01:22:50,250
Come. Come.
来

1042
01:22:51,540 --> 01:22:53,910
I failed. I made a mistake.
我失败了 我犯了大错

1043
01:22:54,660 --> 01:22:56,660
-No, you didn't fail. I saw your papers. -I did.
-你没有失败 我看过你的图纸了 -失败了

1044
01:22:56,750 --> 01:22:58,790
-It's perfect. -The Creature is extremely dangerous.
-非常完美 -那头怪物极其危险

1045
01:22:58,870 --> 01:23:00,620
There's not… Victor.
没有…维克多

1046
01:23:01,120 --> 01:23:03,120
Let's wait for Harlander and discuss together.
我们等哈兰德回来 再一起讨论吧

1047
01:23:03,200 --> 01:23:05,540
William, there is something you should know.
威廉 有件事我得告诉你

1048
01:23:06,330 --> 01:23:07,620
Something I have to show you.
我得给你看一下

1049
01:23:13,540 --> 01:23:16,370
-Ha-- Harlander… -In a fit of rage, he killed him.
-哈兰德… -那头怪物突然暴怒 把他杀了

1050
01:23:22,700 --> 01:23:25,870
Do you understand now why I was hesitant to share this with you?
这下你知道 我为什么没有及时告诉你了吧？

1051
01:23:26,500 --> 01:23:28,200
And certainly not with Elizabeth.
当然也不敢让伊丽莎白知道

1052
01:23:31,830 --> 01:23:33,500
S… So what's to be done now?
那现在怎么办？

1053
01:23:34,120 --> 01:23:34,950
What?
什么？

1054
01:23:35,040 --> 01:23:36,660
-What's to be done? -"What's to be done"?
-现在怎么办？ -你说怎么办？

1055
01:23:36,750 --> 01:23:38,450
You must take Elizabeth back to Vienna.
你得带伊丽莎白回维也纳

1056
01:23:38,540 --> 01:23:41,790
Tell her something urgent came up and you have to leave immediately.
就说出了急事 必须马上走

1057
01:23:41,870 --> 01:23:43,250
Keep her in the dark.
千万别让她知道

1058
01:23:44,540 --> 01:23:45,540
For her own safety.
这是为了保护她

1059
01:23:46,160 --> 01:23:47,580
You have to do as I say.
必须照我说的办

1060
01:23:47,660 --> 01:23:50,450
We'll be back in no time. But for now, this is for the best.
我们很快就回来 但现在只能先走

1061
01:23:51,700 --> 01:23:53,750
Now get in the carriage, please.
请上马车吧

1062
01:24:06,790 --> 01:24:08,910
The Creature, what's its lifespan, you think?
你觉得那头怪物能活多久？

1063
01:24:09,910 --> 01:24:12,660
Brief. Very brief, I'm sure.
必然没多久

1064
01:24:59,370 --> 01:25:01,120
I have the most terrible feeling.
我有种很坏的预感

1065
01:25:05,160 --> 01:25:06,040
What is it?
怎么了？

1066
01:25:07,660 --> 01:25:08,950
Turn the carriage around.
让马车回头

1067
01:25:10,080 --> 01:25:11,500
You go to Vienna.
你一个人去维也纳吧

1068
01:25:12,830 --> 01:25:15,580
Turn the carriage around or I will jump. He's going to kill him.
让马车回头 否则我就跳车 他要杀了他

1069
01:25:25,500 --> 01:25:26,580
Say one word.
说个词吧

1070
01:25:27,120 --> 01:25:28,580
One word more. Anything.
再说一个 随便什么

1071
01:25:29,580 --> 01:25:30,580
Make me save you.
你说了 我就不杀你

1072
01:25:35,910 --> 01:25:36,950
-Victor.
维克多

1073
01:25:44,870 --> 01:25:46,950
Elizabeth.
伊丽莎白

1074
01:26:27,500 --> 01:26:30,950
Victor! Victor!
维克多！

1075
01:26:36,700 --> 01:26:38,620
Victor!
维克多！

1076
01:26:39,330 --> 01:26:41,620
Victor!
维克多！

1077
01:27:31,450 --> 01:27:33,700
But that was not the end of it.
但故事并未结束

1078
01:27:33,790 --> 01:27:37,080
In seeking life, I created death.
我试着创造生命 结果造就了死亡

1079
01:27:43,330 --> 01:27:45,950
It would seem I need to address my men again.
看来又要和他们聊聊了

1080
01:27:50,290 --> 01:27:51,120
Don't worry.
别担心

1081
01:27:52,000 --> 01:27:52,950
They'll listen to me.
他们会听我的话的

1082
01:27:57,200 --> 01:28:00,450
No, no, stop! Do not harm him! I'm here.
住手！别伤害他！我在这里

1083
01:28:00,950 --> 01:28:01,950
Take me.
带走我吧

1084
01:28:02,870 --> 01:28:04,040
Go on, beast.
来吧 野兽

1085
01:28:04,120 --> 01:28:07,580
Kill us both. Confirm your maker's tale.
把我俩都杀了 证明造你的人说的都是真的

1086
01:28:13,500 --> 01:28:18,040
My maker… told his tale.
造我的人 说了他的故事

1087
01:28:23,870 --> 01:28:26,660
Then I will tell you mine.
那我也来说说我的

1088
01:28:30,160 --> 01:28:33,080
{\an8}第二部分
那头怪物的故事

1089
01:28:42,790 --> 01:28:48,410
Victor!
维克多！

1090
01:28:48,500 --> 01:28:52,830
I called your name and understood I was alone.
我反复呼唤你的名字 终于发现这里只有我

1091
01:32:52,870 --> 01:32:54,200
-What is that? -Shoot at it!
-那是什么？ -开枪！

1092
01:32:54,290 --> 01:32:55,120
Shoot it!
开枪！

1093
01:33:00,950 --> 01:33:02,330
Did you get it?
打到了吗？

1094
01:33:05,620 --> 01:33:06,700
Where is it?
去哪了？

1095
01:33:27,080 --> 01:33:28,910
My wounds had healed.
身上的伤口愈合了

1096
01:33:31,910 --> 01:33:35,700
But I felt cold, so cold.
但我觉得寒冷刺骨

1097
01:35:08,580 --> 01:35:10,540
-Can you start the fire? -All right.
-能把火生起来吗？ -好

1098
01:35:10,620 --> 01:35:12,540
And I'll repair the corral as soon as I can.
我会尽快把畜栏修好

1099
01:35:19,410 --> 01:35:20,950
You all right, then? Did you get it?
你没事吧 打到了吗？

1100
01:35:21,040 --> 01:35:23,370
Nah, we looked everywhere. Couldn't find that thing.
没有 我们到处看了 就是找不到

1101
01:35:23,450 --> 01:35:25,080
Though we shot at it two times.
虽然我们朝它开了两枪

1102
01:35:25,160 --> 01:35:27,330
Blood trail died about a mile from here.
血迹在离这里一公里多的地方消失了

1103
01:35:27,410 --> 01:35:29,250
All right. Come in. Come in.
好 进来吧

1104
01:35:29,830 --> 01:35:34,040
We followed it for a while and then it disappeared. Gone.
我们跟了它一段时间 接着它就消失了

1105
01:35:34,120 --> 01:35:36,120
What was it? Was it a bear?
那是什么东西？熊吗？

1106
01:35:36,200 --> 01:35:39,500
That was no bear or human. I've never seen anything like it.
不是熊 也不是人类 我从没见过那样的东西

1107
01:35:39,580 --> 01:35:40,950
Was it a ghost, then?
那么是幽灵吗？

1108
01:35:41,040 --> 01:35:44,290
It was no ghost. We drew blood. It was flesh and bone.
不是 它流血了 说明它有血肉 有骨头

1109
01:35:44,370 --> 01:35:45,620
Come, come. Over here.
来这边

1110
01:35:45,700 --> 01:35:47,120
Tell me more about what you saw.
你还看到了什么

1111
01:35:47,200 --> 01:35:50,120
Anna-Maria, take your grandfather over by the fireplace.
安娜玛丽亚 带祖父去壁炉边

1112
01:35:50,200 --> 01:35:51,700
Make sure he's comfortable.
让他暖一暖

1113
01:35:52,790 --> 01:35:54,120
Over here, Grandfather.
到这边来 祖父

1114
01:35:56,370 --> 01:35:58,410
We went deep into the forest. Couldn't find it.
我们钻到了森林深处 还是没找到它

1115
01:36:04,620 --> 01:36:06,000
We will get it.
会抓到它的

1116
01:36:06,080 --> 01:36:07,660
-It'll take time. -Yeah.
-就是要花些时间 -好

1117
01:36:08,620 --> 01:36:10,410
Anna-Maria, come.
安娜玛丽亚 过来

1118
01:36:10,910 --> 01:36:12,750
Come, love. Help me outside.
宝贝 来带我出去

1119
01:36:23,370 --> 01:36:25,370
The old man moved me.
那位老人触动了我

1120
01:36:29,750 --> 01:36:32,700
And his unseeing eyes were full of wisdom.
他失明的双目充满智慧

1121
01:36:45,540 --> 01:36:47,620
These people possessed a sound.
这些人会发出一种声音

1122
01:36:49,080 --> 01:36:50,910
Used it to tell each other
用来和彼此

1123
01:36:51,000 --> 01:36:54,500
about feelings and ideas.
交流感受和想法

1124
01:36:56,160 --> 01:36:58,370
They called them words.
他们把这种声音叫言语

1125
01:37:01,700 --> 01:37:02,790
Pay attention.
注意看

1126
01:37:03,660 --> 01:37:04,580
What is this?
这是什么？

1127
01:37:05,160 --> 01:37:06,160
A boy.
一个男孩

1128
01:37:07,410 --> 01:37:09,200
-And again. -A boy.
-再说一遍 -一个男孩

1129
01:37:10,200 --> 01:37:11,410
Very good, my child.
很好 孩子

1130
01:37:12,910 --> 01:37:13,870
And this?
这个呢？

1131
01:37:13,950 --> 01:37:16,000
An… An eye.
一只…一只眼睛

1132
01:37:16,790 --> 01:37:18,620
-And again. -An eye.
-再说一遍 -一只眼睛

1133
01:37:18,700 --> 01:37:21,700
Yeah. Well done. Well done, my girl.
很好 乖孩子

1134
01:37:21,790 --> 01:37:23,790
-Eye. -And this one?
-眼睛 -这个呢？

1135
01:37:23,870 --> 01:37:24,830
The hand.
手

1136
01:37:24,910 --> 01:37:26,870
-Very good. -Hand.
-很好 -手

1137
01:37:27,790 --> 01:37:28,700
Give us a hand.
来搭把手

1138
01:37:28,790 --> 01:37:31,160
Tie a rope around the biggest one back there.
用绳子把最大的捆住带回去

1139
01:37:31,250 --> 01:37:33,660
I longed to be part of this family.
我渴望加入这个家庭

1140
01:37:34,330 --> 01:37:36,370
We'll need more kindling before the winter.
冬天之前要再多储备一些柴火

1141
01:37:36,450 --> 01:37:38,000
We'll take a few trips.
我们得跑几趟

1142
01:37:38,620 --> 01:37:40,540
To be their benefactor.
渴望帮他们的忙

1143
01:37:41,120 --> 01:37:42,830
We'll need larger trunks for the structure.
需要大一点的树干来搭这个

1144
01:37:42,910 --> 01:37:43,750
All right.
好

1145
01:37:43,830 --> 01:37:46,750
What could I possibly do for them?
我能为他们做点什么呢？

1146
01:37:52,290 --> 01:37:55,250
Anna-Maria! Father!
安娜玛丽亚！父亲！

1147
01:37:55,330 --> 01:37:57,450
Come! Come and see!
快来看啊！

1148
01:37:59,500 --> 01:38:01,080
Look, Anna-Maria!
看啊 安娜玛丽亚！

1149
01:38:01,160 --> 01:38:02,870
Look, there's more! Look!
看 还有呢！快看！

1150
01:38:05,080 --> 01:38:06,620
Who could have done this?
这会是谁送来的？

1151
01:38:09,870 --> 01:38:11,660
The Spirit of the Forest.
是森林精灵

1152
01:38:13,290 --> 01:38:14,540
We should thank him.
我们得谢谢他

1153
01:38:16,290 --> 01:38:17,330
Thank you.
谢谢你

1154
01:38:17,410 --> 01:38:20,120
Say, "Thank you, Spirit of the Forest."
说“谢谢你 森林精灵”

1155
01:38:20,200 --> 01:38:23,250
Thank you. Thank you, Spirit of the Forest.
谢谢你 森林精灵

1156
01:38:23,330 --> 01:38:24,330
Thank you.
谢谢

1157
01:38:25,370 --> 01:38:26,870
Come. Look over here.
来吧 看这里

1158
01:38:33,500 --> 01:38:34,540
Thank you.
谢谢你

1159
01:38:36,620 --> 01:38:40,250
From then on, I became their invisible guardian.
从此以后 我就成了 他们看不见的守护者

1160
01:38:41,160 --> 01:38:43,250
The Spirit of the Forest.
森林精灵

1161
01:38:44,040 --> 01:38:49,160
And on occasion, they too extended a small kindness towards me.
他们也不时对我释放小小的善意

1162
01:38:50,330 --> 01:38:52,540
Clothes, bread.
送上衣服、面包

1163
01:38:54,750 --> 01:38:56,790
And for a moment,
在那段时光

1164
01:38:57,370 --> 01:39:00,410
a brief, brief moment,
极为短暂的时光

1165
01:39:01,200 --> 01:39:03,540
the world and I were at peace.
我和这个世界相安无事

1166
01:39:11,700 --> 01:39:13,290
Come along. Come along.
跟上

1167
01:39:13,370 --> 01:39:14,250
In you go. Yeah.
进去吧 对

1168
01:39:14,330 --> 01:39:15,700
Make sure you close that gate.
记得关门

1169
01:39:15,790 --> 01:39:17,580
Who could have done this?
是谁做的呢？

1170
01:39:17,660 --> 01:39:19,790
The Spirit of the Forest, eh?
森林精灵吧

1171
01:39:20,910 --> 01:39:21,910
I got it.
我知道了

1172
01:39:24,080 --> 01:39:28,790
"And in the end, the proud young man
“最终 这个骄傲的年轻男子

1173
01:39:28,870 --> 01:39:32,080
could never find his missing hand."
再也找不到他丢失的那只手了

1174
01:39:32,160 --> 01:39:36,330
"It turned to stone, his fortune gone,
它变成了石头 他的财富消失了

1175
01:39:36,410 --> 01:39:40,000
and he lost his pride and lost his land."
他的骄傲 他的土地 都失去了”

1176
01:39:46,080 --> 01:39:48,200
Very good, my dear.
非常好 宝贝

1177
01:39:48,290 --> 01:39:51,200
Beautifully read. Now try this one.
读得真棒 再读下这个吧

1178
01:40:01,250 --> 01:40:02,250
Wolves.
狼来了

1179
01:40:47,700 --> 01:40:48,700
An idea,
某个想法

1180
01:40:49,830 --> 01:40:52,120
a feeling became clear to me.
某种感觉 在我心中愈发清晰

1181
01:40:54,910 --> 01:40:57,450
The hunter did not hate the wolf.
猎人并不憎恨狼

1182
01:40:58,330 --> 01:41:00,700
The wolf did not hate the sheep.
狼并不憎恨羊

1183
01:41:06,410 --> 01:41:09,330
But violence felt inevitable between them.
但相互之间的暴力冲突无可避免

1184
01:41:10,330 --> 01:41:15,540
Perhaps, I thought, this was the way of the world.
我想 也许这正是世界的法则

1185
01:41:16,660 --> 01:41:19,790
It would hunt you and kill you
你成为猎物 被杀

1186
01:41:21,120 --> 01:41:23,370
just for being who you are.
只是因为你的身份

1187
01:41:26,080 --> 01:41:28,410
The sheep will be sold by the end of the month, Father.
父亲 我月末就会把羊卖掉

1188
01:41:29,250 --> 01:41:31,910
Then I'll take you, Alma and Anna-Maria into town.
然后带着你 阿尔玛和安娜玛丽亚去镇上住

1189
01:41:32,700 --> 01:41:33,870
We'll go into the mountains,
我们要上山

1190
01:41:33,950 --> 01:41:36,000
hunt the wolves and be back at the end of winter.
去猎几头狼 冬末回来

1191
01:41:36,080 --> 01:41:41,040
I pray here alone every winter and this year will be no different.
我每年冬天都在这里祈祷 今年也一样

1192
01:41:41,120 --> 01:41:43,750
Please, Father, listen to reason.
父亲 求你了 听劝吧

1193
01:41:43,830 --> 01:41:47,330
You do what you must and so will I.
你们该怎么做就怎么做 我也一样

1194
01:41:51,160 --> 01:41:52,620
You stubborn old goat.
老顽固

1195
01:41:55,250 --> 01:41:57,620
It's just you and I now, Spirit.
现在只有你和我了 森林精灵

1196
01:41:58,500 --> 01:42:00,000
Just you and I.
就你和我了

1197
01:42:00,580 --> 01:42:05,200
And I had formed in my imagination many ways
我已经构想了无数种方式

1198
01:42:05,290 --> 01:42:07,950
I would present myself to the old man.
我要在这个老头面前现身

1199
01:42:09,620 --> 01:42:11,000
Would he fear me?
他会怕我？

1200
01:42:12,410 --> 01:42:13,580
Welcome me?
欢迎我？

1201
01:42:15,040 --> 01:42:16,250
Turn me away?
还是会赶我走呢？

1202
01:42:23,750 --> 01:42:24,580
Who goes there?
谁在那里？

1203
01:42:30,910 --> 01:42:35,160
With a single step, I entered a different world.
上前一步 我进入了完全不同的世界

1204
01:42:36,370 --> 01:42:38,910
One I had only seen from afar.
曾经我只能远远观望的世界

1205
01:42:41,200 --> 01:42:42,910
Please, who is it?
到底是谁？

1206
01:42:43,540 --> 01:42:44,540
Answer me.
出个声吧

1207
01:42:45,910 --> 01:42:46,790
Tell me.
告诉我

1208
01:42:47,410 --> 01:42:48,910
Why are you here?
你来干什么的？

1209
01:42:51,330 --> 01:42:52,200
Travel.
路过

1210
01:42:52,790 --> 01:42:54,580
Welcome, dear traveler.
亲爱的过客 欢迎你

1211
01:42:55,620 --> 01:43:01,410
Do not think me ungrateful for the company if I ask you to procure a chair.
请你自己找把椅子 不要觉得我怠慢了你

1212
01:43:01,500 --> 01:43:06,250
I… I find it difficult being a good host.
我没法周到待客

1213
01:43:06,330 --> 01:43:07,160
Yes.
没错

1214
01:43:07,250 --> 01:43:10,830
My… My sight has failed me.
我的眼睛看不见

1215
01:43:12,660 --> 01:43:16,660
But there is bread and brandy on the table.
桌上有面包和白兰地

1216
01:43:16,750 --> 01:43:17,870
Pray help yourself.
请自行享用

1217
01:43:20,080 --> 01:43:21,540
Bran… dy?
白兰地？

1218
01:43:22,870 --> 01:43:24,330
Your language.
听你说话

1219
01:43:25,000 --> 01:43:28,330
You have a hard time speaking it.
好像不大流利

1220
01:43:28,910 --> 01:43:31,000
Are you not from these parts?
你是不是从别的地方来的？

1221
01:43:36,790 --> 01:43:37,660
Are you afraid?
你害怕吗？

1222
01:43:39,620 --> 01:43:40,870
No need to be.
不用怕

1223
01:43:45,870 --> 01:43:47,500
What are you afraid of?
你在怕什么？

1224
01:43:48,250 --> 01:43:49,290
-Everything. 
什么都怕

1225
01:43:49,370 --> 01:43:50,200
-Your…
你的…

1226
01:43:50,790 --> 01:43:53,250
Your hands are frozen
你的手好冷

1227
01:43:53,790 --> 01:43:57,450
and you've been hurt, have you not?
你还受伤了

1228
01:43:57,540 --> 01:43:58,410
Hurt?
受伤？

1229
01:43:58,500 --> 01:44:05,250
Yes. Your hands and face have scars
没错 你的手上和脸上都有伤疤

1230
01:44:05,330 --> 01:44:06,950
and you are wearing uniform.
你还穿着制服

1231
01:44:07,040 --> 01:44:08,870
Were you injured in battle?
是在战斗中受的伤吗？

1232
01:44:12,120 --> 01:44:12,950
You were hiding
你一直

1233
01:44:14,080 --> 01:44:16,500
in the mill gears, were you not?
躲在磨坊齿轮里面 对吧？

1234
01:44:21,080 --> 01:44:24,250
Yeah. Yeah. The Spirit of the Forest.
对 你就是森林精灵

1235
01:44:24,330 --> 01:44:25,160
Yes.
没错

1236
01:44:26,040 --> 01:44:28,500
I cannot judge of your countenance,
我看不到你的面容

1237
01:44:29,330 --> 01:44:31,660
but there is something in your voice
但听你的嗓音

1238
01:44:31,750 --> 01:44:35,620
which persuades me of your goodwill and kindness.
你肯定很善良

1239
01:44:36,120 --> 01:44:37,200
-Kindness? -Mm.
善良？

1240
01:44:39,620 --> 01:44:41,700
Stay with me.
留下来吧

1241
01:44:43,040 --> 01:44:45,620
Share my food and fire.
你可以吃我的东西 烤我的火

1242
01:44:46,120 --> 01:44:50,000
I would be delighted to share what little I have with you
我有的不多 但能跟你分享 我会很高兴的

1243
01:44:50,080 --> 01:44:53,660
and would be greatly helped by your companionship.
有你陪着我 对我也大有好处

1244
01:44:54,330 --> 01:44:57,450
And you… you could read to me.
你可以读书给我听

1245
01:44:57,950 --> 01:44:58,870
-Read? -Mm.
读书？

1246
01:45:00,120 --> 01:45:05,870
Make this your home and I your friend.
把这里当成自己家 把我当成朋友

1247
01:45:07,500 --> 01:45:08,370
Friend.
朋友

1248
01:45:13,750 --> 01:45:14,750
Friend.
朋友

1249
01:45:23,330 --> 01:45:24,160
Friends.
朋友

1250
01:45:25,580 --> 01:45:29,620
And it was then that I read my first story,
就是在那时 我读到了我生命中第一个故事

1251
01:45:30,620 --> 01:45:33,160
and it was the first story.
也是《圣经》中的第一个故事

1252
01:45:34,370 --> 01:45:39,330
I read about a man named Adam and a woman named Eve,
故事的主人公是一个名叫亚当的男子 和名叫夏娃的女子

1253
01:45:40,200 --> 01:45:43,580
about their time in the first garden.
他们住在人类的第一个乐园里

1254
01:45:44,450 --> 01:45:47,660
I read about the rise of rival cities
我读到了两座城市崛起 相互竞争

1255
01:45:48,160 --> 01:45:49,910
and the collapse of a tower
一座高塔倒塌

1256
01:45:50,410 --> 01:45:52,750
and the wrath of a God.
上帝震怒毁城

1257
01:45:53,330 --> 01:45:57,750
And I read about men that fought dragons
我读到人类斗巨龙

1258
01:45:57,830 --> 01:46:00,500
and men who lost everything.
最终失去一切

1259
01:46:01,370 --> 01:46:03,040
And time passed
时光流逝

1260
01:46:03,620 --> 01:46:06,870
and fell away with the leaves of autumn.
如秋叶飘落

1261
01:46:18,540 --> 01:46:21,660
Have you never seen the snow, my dear friend?
亲爱的朋友 你见过下雪吗？

1262
01:46:23,330 --> 01:46:27,080
It makes the world clean… and new.
大雪荡涤一切 让世界焕然一新

1263
01:46:33,000 --> 01:46:37,830
"My name is Ozymandias, King of Kings."
“吾乃奥兹曼迪亚斯 万王之王

1264
01:46:38,330 --> 01:46:41,660
"Look on my works, ye Mighty, and despair."
盖世功业 敢叫天公折服

1265
01:46:42,950 --> 01:46:45,200
"No thing beside remains."
此外无一物

1266
01:46:45,750 --> 01:46:50,080
"Round the decay of that colossal wreck, boundless and bare."
但见废墟周围 寂寞平沙空莽莽

1267
01:46:50,160 --> 01:46:53,870
"The lone and level sands stretch far away."
伸向荒凉的四方

1268
01:46:55,500 --> 01:46:58,450
"My name is Ozymandias…"
吾乃奥兹曼迪亚斯”

1269
01:47:05,200 --> 01:47:07,700
Are there more books than this in the world?
世上哪里的书比这里还多？

1270
01:47:09,750 --> 01:47:11,620
A few more, I'm sure.
肯定还有一些地方

1271
01:47:12,370 --> 01:47:13,790
Not here.
不是这里

1272
01:47:15,830 --> 01:47:19,250
Last book on the left. Take it.
左边最后 就拿那本

1273
01:47:19,330 --> 01:47:21,370
We haven't got to it.
那本还没读过

1274
01:47:21,450 --> 01:47:24,200
Paradise Lost, Milton.
弥尔顿的《失乐园》

1275
01:47:24,290 --> 01:47:27,200
Man has questions for God.
人类对上帝有疑问

1276
01:47:27,950 --> 01:47:30,330
Even God has questions.
就连上帝自己也有疑问

1277
01:47:31,040 --> 01:47:35,750
I think he wanted answers and that is why he sent us his son.
我觉得上帝也想得到答案 所以才会派来自己的儿子

1278
01:47:36,330 --> 01:47:38,790
Death probably intrigued him.
或许他很想了解死亡

1279
01:47:39,410 --> 01:47:40,290
Suffering.
了解受苦受难

1280
01:47:41,450 --> 01:47:44,410
I want to know who I am.
我想知道我是谁

1281
01:47:45,160 --> 01:47:46,910
Where do I come from?
我从哪里来？

1282
01:47:47,450 --> 01:47:52,750
God took your memory just as I wish he would take mine away.
上帝拿走了你的记忆 而我多么希望我的记忆也被带走

1283
01:47:54,200 --> 01:47:57,500
Many years ago, I took a man's life.
多年前 我拿走了某个人的生命

1284
01:47:58,160 --> 01:47:59,080
A good man.
那是个好人

1285
01:47:59,620 --> 01:48:02,040
And I have been atoning for it since.
自那时起 我一直在赎罪

1286
01:48:04,330 --> 01:48:05,200
Forgive.
试着原谅

1287
01:48:06,120 --> 01:48:06,950
Forget.
试着忘记

1288
01:48:07,660 --> 01:48:09,580
The true measure of wisdom.
智慧真正的试金石

1289
01:48:10,790 --> 01:48:12,910
To know you have been harmed,
是知道自己受了伤害

1290
01:48:13,000 --> 01:48:15,160
by whom you have been harmed,
知道被谁伤害

1291
01:48:15,250 --> 01:48:18,120
and choose to let it all fade.
然后选择让一切烟消云散

1292
01:48:19,200 --> 01:48:23,160
But I cannot forget what I cannot remember.
但记不起来的东西 要怎么忘记

1293
01:48:23,250 --> 01:48:24,660
Do you recall nothing?
你什么都记不起来吗？

1294
01:48:30,120 --> 01:48:32,830
In my dreams…
在睡梦中

1295
01:48:35,620 --> 01:48:38,870
…I… see memories.
我…能窥见记忆

1296
01:48:42,200 --> 01:48:43,750
Different men.
各种各样的人

1297
01:48:46,200 --> 01:48:48,790
All… pieces.
都是…一些片断

1298
01:48:56,000 --> 01:48:57,000
I…
我…

1299
01:48:59,330 --> 01:49:03,080
I remember f… fire and water.
我记得有火 有水

1300
01:49:06,250 --> 01:49:08,160
And sand under my feet.
脚下有沙子

1301
01:49:15,330 --> 01:49:16,580
And a word.
还有一个词

1302
01:49:19,250 --> 01:49:20,750
A single word.
就一个词

1303
01:49:23,200 --> 01:49:24,500
What is it?
什么词？

1304
01:49:27,290 --> 01:49:28,290
Victor.
维克多

1305
01:49:29,580 --> 01:49:30,750
Go to it.
去找到它

1306
01:49:31,790 --> 01:49:32,910
The word.
维克多

1307
01:50:09,750 --> 01:50:11,790
And then I learned it.
然后我终于体会到了

1308
01:50:12,700 --> 01:50:14,910
The horror of the truth.
真相的可怖

1309
01:50:20,700 --> 01:50:23,870
I understood that I was nothing.
我明白了 自己一无是处

1310
01:50:25,160 --> 01:50:26,370
A wretch.
是个可怜虫

1311
01:50:27,080 --> 01:50:28,370
A blot.
是块不起眼的污渍

1312
01:50:28,910 --> 01:50:32,040
Not even of the same nature as man.
甚至算不上是人类

1313
01:50:35,250 --> 01:50:37,040
This hurt clung to my mind.
这种痛苦缠绕着我

1314
01:50:39,750 --> 01:50:41,450
It never let go.
永不消散

1315
01:51:24,870 --> 01:51:26,450
Then I saw it.
然后我看见了

1316
01:51:28,080 --> 01:51:29,450
Your name.
你的名字

1317
01:51:30,200 --> 01:51:33,700
"Victor Frankenstein."
“维克多·弗兰肯斯坦”

1318
01:51:33,790 --> 01:51:35,750
And where to find you.
知道了到哪里能找到你

1319
01:51:57,000 --> 01:51:58,250
No!
不！

1320
01:51:59,500 --> 01:52:01,250
No!
不！

1321
01:53:10,290 --> 01:53:11,700
You came back.
你回来了

1322
01:53:11,790 --> 01:53:14,080
I found what I am.
我知道我是谁了

1323
01:53:18,290 --> 01:53:20,700
What I am made from.
知道我是什么造就的了

1324
01:53:23,410 --> 01:53:28,040
I am… the child of a charnel house.
我…我是尸骨堆里造出来的

1325
01:53:31,330 --> 01:53:32,660
A wreckage.
我是残骸

1326
01:53:33,910 --> 01:53:37,200
Assembled from refuse and the discarded dead.
是用垃圾和被丢弃的尸体拼凑出来的

1327
01:53:43,910 --> 01:53:45,120
A monster.
是怪物

1328
01:53:46,700 --> 01:53:49,000
I know what you are.
我知道你是谁

1329
01:53:51,200 --> 01:53:52,330
A good man.
你是个好人

1330
01:53:53,200 --> 01:53:57,700
And… you are my friend.
也是我的朋友

1331
01:54:07,450 --> 01:54:08,620
Friend?
朋友？

1332
01:54:10,580 --> 01:54:11,750
Friend.
朋友

1333
01:54:14,830 --> 01:54:16,120
What is that thing?
那是什么？

1334
01:54:17,790 --> 01:54:19,660
The-- The thing from the woods?
是森林里的那东西吗？

1335
01:54:20,910 --> 01:54:22,000
What have you done to him?
你把他怎么了？

1336
01:54:24,330 --> 01:54:25,290
Don't move.
别动

1337
01:54:36,580 --> 01:54:38,910
Quick! Reload! Kill it!
快！上膛！杀了它！

1338
01:55:53,000 --> 01:55:55,040
There was silence again,
一切重回寂静

1339
01:55:56,330 --> 01:56:01,450
and then… merciless life.
而冷酷无情的生活还将继续

1340
01:56:16,870 --> 01:56:18,790
How long did I die for?
我死了多久？

1341
01:56:19,370 --> 01:56:20,660
I do not know.
不知道

1342
01:56:21,370 --> 01:56:23,660
But I saw my injuries healed.
但我看到身上的伤口愈合了

1343
01:56:24,750 --> 01:56:28,370
The cold winter air stung in my lungs.
冬日的寒风直灌入肺

1344
01:56:36,500 --> 01:56:39,620
I felt lonelier than ever,
孤独感更甚以往 且前所未有

1345
01:56:40,620 --> 01:56:45,450
because for every man there was but one remedy to all pain:
因为对世人而言 治愈一切痛苦的良药

1346
01:56:46,540 --> 01:56:51,160
Death, a gift you too had denied me.
唯有死亡 而这恩赐你也狠心剥夺

1347
01:56:52,040 --> 01:56:54,160
Envy rose within me
我的内心涌起羡慕之情

1348
01:56:55,080 --> 01:56:58,080
and decided to demand a single grace from you.
遂决意向你索求一份恩典

1349
01:56:59,330 --> 01:57:01,040
My creator.
我的缔造者

1350
01:57:02,370 --> 01:57:06,830
I would demand… a companion.
我想要…一个同伴

1351
01:57:33,540 --> 01:57:34,950
I need you to get up.
起来吧

1352
01:57:36,290 --> 01:57:37,830
Yes, of course. Of course.
好的

1353
01:57:37,910 --> 01:57:40,700
The wedding will start soon and I want you by my side.
婚礼马上要开始了 你得陪在我身边

1354
01:57:41,410 --> 01:57:42,700
It's hard to believe,
要不是你天性善良

1355
01:57:43,750 --> 01:57:45,750
if not for your kind nature.
我都不敢相信这话是你说的

1356
01:58:00,830 --> 01:58:03,200
I've spoken to a few guests about the inquest.
我跟几位宾客说了调查的事

1357
01:58:04,120 --> 01:58:05,200
About the explosion.
关于那场爆炸的调查

1358
01:58:07,000 --> 01:58:09,160
The majority accept it for what it was.
他们中的大多数都接受了官方的说法

1359
01:58:11,450 --> 01:58:13,450
And what was it, William?
官方怎么说 威廉？

1360
01:58:14,870 --> 01:58:15,950
The past, Victor.
都过去了 维克多

1361
01:58:17,620 --> 01:58:18,910
A terrible accident.
那是场可怕的意外

1362
01:58:26,290 --> 01:58:28,080
I intend to sell the estate.
我想卖了那座庄园

1363
01:58:31,500 --> 01:58:33,540
All we have is each other.
我们只有彼此了

1364
01:58:49,250 --> 01:58:51,160
I want you to throw the petals everywhere.
往四面八方撒

1365
01:58:51,250 --> 01:58:52,660
Throw them everywhere.
到处都撒一点

1366
01:58:55,200 --> 01:58:56,950
Go upstairs and do some more of that.
到楼上去 再多撒点

1367
01:59:06,370 --> 01:59:09,830
I know it is bad luck to see the bride before the ceremony.
我知道 婚礼前见新娘会带来厄运

1368
01:59:10,450 --> 01:59:11,660
Only for the groom.
只对新郎起效

1369
01:59:13,410 --> 01:59:14,950
Yes, that's right. Not for me.
没错 对我没用

1370
01:59:17,160 --> 01:59:18,370
Hello, Elizabeth.
你好啊 伊丽莎白

1371
01:59:21,290 --> 01:59:24,790
I've rarely felt remorse before and now I feel little else. I…
之前我从未感受过懊悔 而现在懊悔充斥了我的内心

1372
01:59:25,500 --> 01:59:29,660
A fever gripped me for so long, but it has passed,
我的心被一种冲动占据已久 但这种感觉已经消散

1373
01:59:29,750 --> 01:59:31,750
and I see you now as I should.
我可以正常地面对你了

1374
01:59:33,450 --> 01:59:37,620
For whatever it's worth, I… I wish you and my little brother,
无论如何 我衷心祝愿

1375
01:59:37,700 --> 01:59:40,410
who I love more than life, the very best.
你和我挚爱的弟弟幸福

1376
01:59:43,160 --> 01:59:45,120
You may like to believe you do.
你大可以自欺欺人

1377
01:59:49,160 --> 01:59:51,040
And I dread to even hear it.
而我都害怕听见

1378
01:59:55,200 --> 01:59:57,910
On my wedding day, I ask you but for a single grace.
今天是我的大喜之日 我就求你一件事

1379
01:59:59,160 --> 02:00:00,370
No more lies.
别撒谎了

1380
02:00:01,790 --> 02:00:04,000
-I-- I want to tell you-- -Leave my chambers now.
-我想告诉你… -给我出去

1381
02:00:04,080 --> 02:00:05,870
-Elizabeth. -Leave!
-伊丽莎白 -出去！

1382
02:01:00,080 --> 02:01:01,870
Come out of the shadows,
出来 别躲在暗处

1383
02:01:03,160 --> 02:01:04,450
if you are here.
如果你在这里

1384
02:01:21,910 --> 02:01:23,160
Are you here to thank me?
你是来感谢我的吗？

1385
02:01:23,750 --> 02:01:27,290
You survived and are intelligent enough to have found me.
你活下来了 还变得足够聪明 都找到我了

1386
02:01:29,290 --> 02:01:30,700
I made you well.
是我造得好

1387
02:01:30,790 --> 02:01:37,450
I need you to make a companion for me.
我要你给我造一个同伴

1388
02:01:38,160 --> 02:01:40,200
One like me.
像我这样的

1389
02:01:40,290 --> 02:01:42,000
A com… A companion?
同伴？

1390
02:01:48,040 --> 02:01:49,040
I see.
我知道了

1391
02:01:53,330 --> 02:01:54,660
Another monster.
再来个怪物

1392
02:01:55,330 --> 02:01:56,330
Yes.
对

1393
02:01:57,200 --> 02:01:59,370
We can be monsters together.
让我们两个怪物作伴

1394
02:02:02,580 --> 02:02:07,040
I have found sanity at such a cost,
我付出巨大代价 才找回了理智

1395
02:02:07,120 --> 02:02:11,500
and you here… are madness calling me back.
你却想让我再回疯狂

1396
02:02:11,580 --> 02:02:13,620
I cannot die.
我死不了

1397
02:02:17,250 --> 02:02:19,290
And I cannot live…
只有我自己

1398
02:02:21,910 --> 02:02:22,910
alone.
我也活不好

1399
02:02:24,160 --> 02:02:26,700
In you I have created something truly horrible.
我造出了非常恐怖的东西

1400
02:02:28,080 --> 02:02:29,950
Not something.
不是东西

1401
02:02:30,910 --> 02:02:32,660
Someone.
是人

1402
02:02:33,660 --> 02:02:36,830
You made someone.
你造出了人

1403
02:02:37,620 --> 02:02:38,540
Me.
就是我

1404
02:02:39,450 --> 02:02:42,250
Whatever puzzle I am, creator, I think.
不管我多么让人费解 但我会思考

1405
02:02:43,160 --> 02:02:44,410
I feel.
有感受

1406
02:02:45,870 --> 02:02:47,580
I have this sole petition…
我只有这一个请求

1407
02:02:48,450 --> 02:02:52,540
Make one like me.
再造一个像我一样的

1408
02:02:54,290 --> 02:02:55,410
And then what?
然后呢？

1409
02:02:56,500 --> 02:02:58,200
Procreation.
生育

1410
02:03:00,000 --> 02:03:01,620
Reproduction.
繁殖

1411
02:03:06,450 --> 02:03:07,620
A home?
建立家庭？

1412
02:03:08,540 --> 02:03:09,950
A grave?
建造坟墓？

1413
02:03:11,540 --> 02:03:15,250
Death begetting death begetting death.
死亡与破坏不断上演

1414
02:03:15,330 --> 02:03:17,580
A race of devils propagated upon the earth.
恶魔的种族在地球上蔓延

1415
02:03:17,660 --> 02:03:19,620
Obscenity perpetuating itself.
肮脏永不断绝

1416
02:03:20,410 --> 02:03:23,910
I am obscene to you, but to myself I simply am.
在你看来我很肮脏 在我看来我只是我

1417
02:03:24,000 --> 02:03:25,160
Begone!
滚开！

1418
02:03:27,620 --> 02:03:33,830
Never again will I make something like you, wicked and deformed.
我绝不会再造一个 像你这么邪恶丑陋的东西

1419
02:03:38,290 --> 02:03:44,330
Then it is still all about your will, Victor.
这一切还不都是 源自你的执念 维克多

1420
02:03:47,080 --> 02:03:52,410
That horrible, horrible will that birthed me condemns me now?
凭恐怖的执念造就我 如今又固执地谴责我

1421
02:03:53,700 --> 02:03:58,330
The miracle is not that I should speak, but that you would ever listen!
我开口说话算不上奇迹 你愿意倾听才算！

1422
02:04:02,080 --> 02:04:07,330
If you are not to award me love, then I will indulge in rage.
你不愿赐我伴侣 我将倾泻怒火

1423
02:04:07,410 --> 02:04:08,950
And mine is infinite.
无穷无尽的怒火

1424
02:04:15,200 --> 02:04:16,500
Step aside.
请让一让

1425
02:04:16,580 --> 02:04:17,500
Victor.
维克多

1426
02:04:18,870 --> 02:04:19,910
What's going on?
怎么了？

1427
02:04:38,660 --> 02:04:39,700
You…
你

1428
02:04:44,620 --> 02:04:45,500
You…
你

1429
02:04:46,660 --> 02:04:47,580
It's you.
是你

1430
02:04:52,870 --> 02:04:55,000
Elizabeth, move away from it!
伊丽莎白 离它远一点！

1431
02:04:55,700 --> 02:04:56,620
No!
不要！

1432
02:05:10,660 --> 02:05:13,500
It attacked her! It attacked her!
那东西袭击了她！

1433
02:05:32,950 --> 02:05:34,290
Take me with you.
带我走吧

1434
02:05:48,830 --> 02:05:49,910
Oh, my God!
天啊

1435
02:06:16,200 --> 02:06:18,500
No, let me… I can save you.
别动 让我来…我能救你

1436
02:06:18,580 --> 02:06:19,660
I can save you.
我会救活你

1437
02:06:20,330 --> 02:06:21,330
From what?
救我？

1438
02:06:22,410 --> 02:06:23,540
From you?
是害我吧

1439
02:06:25,330 --> 02:06:26,700
I fear you, Victor.
我怕你 维克多

1440
02:06:26,790 --> 02:06:27,910
No, no…
不

1441
02:06:28,000 --> 02:06:29,290
I always have.
一直怕你

1442
02:06:29,950 --> 02:06:32,410
Every ounce of madness and destruction.
你的每一次疯狂和破坏

1443
02:06:33,580 --> 02:06:37,160
The very conflagration that devoured everything.
如同大火 足以吞噬一切

1444
02:06:39,080 --> 02:06:40,450
It all came from you.
一切都是你造成的

1445
02:06:46,450 --> 02:06:47,950
You are the monster.
你才是怪物

1446
02:07:21,040 --> 02:07:23,200
My place was never in this world.
我和这个世界格格不入

1447
02:07:25,120 --> 02:07:29,450
I sought and longed for something I could not quite name.
我一直渴望并追寻着 一种说不清道不明的东西

1448
02:07:31,580 --> 02:07:33,450
But in you, I found it.
可在你身上 我找到了这种东西

1449
02:07:36,750 --> 02:07:39,200
To be lost and to be found,
丢失并被寻回

1450
02:07:40,200 --> 02:07:42,200
that is the lifespan of love.
这就是爱的宿命

1451
02:07:44,200 --> 02:07:45,620
And in its brevity,
其短暂

1452
02:07:46,870 --> 02:07:48,120
its tragedy…
其悲剧性

1453
02:07:52,200 --> 02:07:53,870
this has been made eternal.
造就永恒

1454
02:07:57,830 --> 02:08:00,870
Better this way… to fade…
就让我在你的注视之中

1455
02:08:03,290 --> 02:08:05,160
with your eyes gazing upon me.
死去吧

1456
02:08:48,200 --> 02:08:51,290
She is gone and I long to follow.
她走了 我也想随她而去

1457
02:08:56,120 --> 02:08:58,250
You gave me life unwanted.
你给了我备受唾弃的生命

1458
02:08:59,580 --> 02:09:01,410
I give that back to you.
我这就还给你

1459
02:09:02,200 --> 02:09:04,120
You thought me a monster.
你当我是怪物

1460
02:09:04,950 --> 02:09:06,580
Now I return the favor.
就让我这个怪物来回敬你

1461
02:09:12,370 --> 02:09:15,160
Kill me! Kill me now, do it!
杀了我 现在就杀了我

1462
02:09:16,410 --> 02:09:18,160
I will make you bleed.
我要让你流血

1463
02:09:19,000 --> 02:09:21,120
I will make you humble.
让你卑微求饶

1464
02:09:21,870 --> 02:09:23,540
You may be my creator,
你是造了我

1465
02:09:24,120 --> 02:09:27,950
but from this day forward, I will be your master.
但从今天起 你要听我的话

1466
02:10:08,040 --> 02:10:12,120
You hunted me past the forests,
你为了猎杀我

1467
02:10:12,950 --> 02:10:14,830
past the mountains,
翻山越岭

1468
02:10:15,540 --> 02:10:17,950
past frozen horizons,
横跨冰川

1469
02:10:19,080 --> 02:10:22,000
until there was nothing left.
直到天地间

1470
02:10:22,580 --> 02:10:25,620
Just you… and me.
只剩你我

1471
02:10:46,120 --> 02:10:47,040
I need ammunition.
给我来点子弹

1472
02:10:50,290 --> 02:10:51,700
Sharpen this.
这个磨快一点

1473
02:10:51,790 --> 02:10:54,160
Three cans of condensed milk, some firewood.
来三罐炼乳 一点木柴

1474
02:10:56,040 --> 02:10:57,500
And six sticks of dynamite.
还有六筒炸药

1475
02:10:57,580 --> 02:10:58,410
Six?
六筒？

1476
02:10:59,370 --> 02:11:00,620
What are you hunting?
你要打什么？

1477
02:11:02,250 --> 02:11:03,500
Big game.
大的

1478
02:12:11,500 --> 02:12:13,450
No! No! No!
不！

1479
02:12:22,330 --> 02:12:24,040
Victor.
维克多

1480
02:12:24,120 --> 02:12:27,160
You only listen when I hurt you.
只有被我伤到 你才会听我说话

1481
02:12:41,330 --> 02:12:44,870
This. You put your faith in this.
这个 你相信这东西

1482
02:12:44,950 --> 02:12:47,250
You think this will unmake me.
能够摧毁我

1483
02:12:51,700 --> 02:12:55,000
Light it then and hope it does, but if it does not,
点着吧 希望如你所愿 但如果失败了

1484
02:12:55,080 --> 02:12:57,160
I will come for you again.
我会再来找你

1485
02:12:57,790 --> 02:12:59,120
Light it!
点起来！

1486
02:13:06,700 --> 02:13:10,040
Now… run.
快跑吧

1487
02:13:47,120 --> 02:13:52,660
So, there you were, broken and discarded.
好了 如今你残破不堪

1488
02:13:53,750 --> 02:13:55,120
And I,
而我

1489
02:13:56,450 --> 02:13:58,250
alive again.
又活过来了

1490
02:14:03,040 --> 02:14:07,950
I could feel my singed flesh regrowing.
我能感到 被灼伤的血肉在重新生长

1491
02:14:08,790 --> 02:14:12,660
The crackling of my bones resetting.
断裂的骨头重回原位

1492
02:14:13,910 --> 02:14:20,250
The murmur of my blood pumping through my incessant heart.
永不停息的心脏泵出汩汩的血流

1493
02:14:21,370 --> 02:14:24,330
And once more finding no mercy,
再次发现无人怜悯

1494
02:14:25,830 --> 02:14:28,290
I had but one path.
我只剩一条路可走

1495
02:14:40,450 --> 02:14:42,200
And here we are.
我们终究走到了这一步

1496
02:14:44,620 --> 02:14:46,540
Spent and done.
精疲力尽 一无所有

1497
02:14:49,330 --> 02:14:52,660
No more in us to give or take.
再没有什么可以付出或索取了

1498
02:14:53,200 --> 02:14:54,620
The blood outside the tent…
帐篷外的血迹

1499
02:14:55,120 --> 02:14:56,160
It is mine.
是我的

1500
02:14:57,330 --> 02:14:58,790
All mine.
都是我的

1501
02:15:00,000 --> 02:15:01,290
I will bleed.
我将流血

1502
02:15:02,830 --> 02:15:03,700
Ache.
疼痛

1503
02:15:04,870 --> 02:15:06,000
Suffer.
受苦

1504
02:15:09,120 --> 02:15:11,950
You see, it will never end.
永无尽头

1505
02:15:31,910 --> 02:15:33,450
I am sorry.
对不起

1506
02:15:39,950 --> 02:15:42,000
Regret consumes me.
我的内心充满懊悔

1507
02:15:44,120 --> 02:15:46,660
And I now regard my life for what it was.
如今我终于能正视我的生命了

1508
02:15:49,160 --> 02:15:51,580
You will go now, creator.
缔造者 你要走了

1509
02:15:54,410 --> 02:15:56,000
Fade away.
要消失了

1510
02:15:58,700 --> 02:16:01,370
It will all be but a brief moment.
一切都只是短暂的一瞬

1511
02:16:03,040 --> 02:16:06,000
My birth. My grief.
我的诞生 我的悲伤

1512
02:16:06,910 --> 02:16:08,370
Your loss.
你的损失

1513
02:16:10,950 --> 02:16:13,200
I will not be punished.
我不会受惩罚

1514
02:16:14,660 --> 02:16:16,410
Nor absolved.
也无法摆脱罪责

1515
02:16:20,830 --> 02:16:22,160
What hope I had,
我的希望

1516
02:16:23,200 --> 02:16:24,750
what rage…
我的怒火

1517
02:16:26,540 --> 02:16:27,910
It is all nothing.
都毫无意义

1518
02:16:31,200 --> 02:16:35,660
The tide that brought me here now comes to take you away.
那股造就我的浪潮 如今要带你走了

1519
02:16:38,160 --> 02:16:39,500
Leaving me stranded.
留下搁浅的我

1520
02:16:47,790 --> 02:16:49,250
Forgive me.
原谅我吧

1521
02:16:51,250 --> 02:16:52,500
My son.
吾儿

1522
02:17:00,750 --> 02:17:05,410
And if you have it in your heart, forgive yourself into existence.
如你有意 也请宽恕自己的存在

1523
02:17:06,040 --> 02:17:10,410
If death is not to be, then consider this, my son.
吾儿 如果无法死去 还请细思此事

1524
02:17:11,080 --> 02:17:12,790
While you are alive,
既然活着

1525
02:17:13,660 --> 02:17:16,450
what recourse do you have but to live?
除了活下去 还有别的选择吗？

1526
02:17:23,870 --> 02:17:24,950
Live.
活着

1527
02:17:26,620 --> 02:17:27,870
Say my name.
说出我的名字吧

1528
02:17:29,700 --> 02:17:31,950
My father gave me that name,
我的名字是父亲起的

1529
02:17:33,120 --> 02:17:34,410
and it meant nothing.
但其实并无意义

1530
02:17:36,950 --> 02:17:39,250
Now I ask you to give it back to me…
现在 我请求你把这个名字还给我

1531
02:17:41,750 --> 02:17:43,120
one last time.
最后一次了

1532
02:17:44,950 --> 02:17:46,700
The way you said it at the beginning.
就像最开始 你把这个名字

1533
02:17:48,290 --> 02:17:50,580
When it meant the world to you.
当成全世界时那样呼唤我

1534
02:17:56,290 --> 02:17:57,500
Victor.
维克多

1535
02:18:00,500 --> 02:18:02,000
I forgive you.
我宽恕你

1536
02:18:25,080 --> 02:18:27,660
Rest now, Father.
安息吧 父亲

1537
02:18:32,160 --> 02:18:33,540
Perhaps now,
或许现在

1538
02:18:35,450 --> 02:18:37,540
we can both be human.
我们都能算作是人了

1539
02:18:47,370 --> 02:18:48,290
Weapons down.
放下武器

1540
02:18:49,000 --> 02:18:51,040
-Put the weapons down! -I am responsible for my men.
-放下武器 -我要为我的人负责

1541
02:18:52,450 --> 02:18:53,700
He can leave.
让他走

1542
02:20:28,580 --> 02:20:29,660
We are free!
船能动了！

1543
02:20:29,750 --> 02:20:31,000
We are free!
我们自由了！

1544
02:20:32,500 --> 02:20:33,790
Captain…
船长

1545
02:20:34,790 --> 02:20:36,160
What are your orders?
您的指令是？

1546
02:20:36,250 --> 02:20:37,250
Man the sails.
扬帆起航

1547
02:20:37,830 --> 02:20:38,700
Turn around.
掉头

1548
02:20:38,790 --> 02:20:40,080
Do you want to tell the men?
您要亲自宣布吗？

1549
02:20:40,700 --> 02:20:41,540
Men!
大家听好！

1550
02:20:42,950 --> 02:20:44,120
We're sailing home!
我们开船回家

1551
02:20:44,830 --> 02:20:45,910
We're sailing home!
我们回家了

1552
